{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:54.204611+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 50.57s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('d86d9435bce04c18acbf9c0336b5d8e8', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107967, 1, 'Welcome To PCA', 'Zoey begins life at PCA. She is nervous about the situation at first, but gets more comfortable when she meets her new friends; Dana, Quinn, Chase,Nicole, Logan, Michael. The girls and boys try to adjust to girls being allowed to attend PCA for the first time.', '2005-01-09', 23, 7.7, 3, '/nd3mJMRS578imlA3X0IkE0YwWCa.jpg', None, '98041b480b494c29be4faa83fba4660c', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107961, 2, 'New Roomies', \"Zoey's roommates, Nicole and Dana, constantly fight. So then, she decides to move in with the girl named, Quinn. After Zoey moves in, she thinks that ... (227 characters truncated) ... sn't want to hurt her feelings. Meanwhile, Logan is pressuring Chase into keeping Zoey away from her roommates so Chase can spend more time with her.\", '2005-01-09', 23, 6.7, 3, '/xDwHzDs9fgZRiy5sD5ckWfBpFtv.jpg', None, '3d0334bc907d4251990c20e88e8de271', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107955, 3, 'Webcam', \"Logan brings a present for the girls, a bear for the girls' lounge. Then people find out their secrets (i.e. Quinn eats baby food) and the girls start to blame each other for telling their secrets. And later trying to find out who is the culprit.\", '2005-01-16', 23, 7.5, 2, '/aYMvqiMRD1PPe77aUPAUuuy9Ri2.jpg', None, 'cb2f148b9c214acf81be773636fdeb02', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107960, 4, 'Defending Dustin', \"When a school bully forces Dustin to do his homework for him, Zoey confronts the bully in public, embarrassing Dustin in the process and further enra ... (227 characters truncated) ...  hide their dog, Elvis away from their dorm advisor, since it's against school rules for having pets on campus. Logan did not appear in this episode.\", '2005-01-23', 23, 7.0, 2, '/6dkBqgT8Gww9ZtIwYfSWWXNDRvY.jpg', None, '64ebbb6ccb5f4b49b356473fe5988e41', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/9aDBUsTdsFH6r9W2YTvBz0OyIkK.jpg', None, 'b38934067ea54e44a9ec98d66a5c8640', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107965, 10, 'Backpack', \"When Nicole pays for a backpack she messed up at the bookstore, she is broke and calling the backpack stupid. But when Zoey re-designed the backpack  ... (47 characters truncated) ... Later on, Zoey's backpack idea is stolen from a girl named, Stacy and she makes a lot of money. So then Zoey and the gang try to seek revenge on her.\", '2005-04-03', 23, 7.0, 2, '/cs4StdaBaDixDOEoU9gZJ9j7vRy.jpg', None, 'f95a68768e3646b3977e2e64564377ae', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107963, 11, 'Disc Golf', 'In this episode the gang is worn out from always running in gym class. Nicole keeps throwing up and is tired of it. To solve this, they decide to put ... (29 characters truncated) ...  keep them from doing gym class. Also, Michael is not happy with his weight due to him being addicted to chips, so he gets Quinn to solve his problem', '2005-04-10', 22, 7.5, 2, '/vgc7aEYbh7VQ1tIyslgPLx8ndmF.jpg', None, '54e609e04eda4d34bbe49230e0fbff70', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107964, 12, 'School Dance', 'The school dance committee implements an experimental personality-based partner selection process. So, Chase tries to get matched up with Zoey, and s ... (102 characters truncated) ...  guy gets matched up with her as well as him. Zoey must pick between Chase and Glen, the other guy. Chase is upset and tries to get Zoey to pick him.', '2005-04-17', 23, 8.0, 1, '/sVRR2fgLFxHWAoEdeRvjdwVcNO1.jpg', None, '061f50415bd9413e879129db51a3467b', '0436e197986f479f95f34b4983c3bb91', 107966, 13, 'Little Beach Party', \"It's the end of the semester and Zoey and her friends are excited for PCA's annual beach party but... they end up going to the wrong beach unsupervis ... (53 characters truncated) ... ere the big PCA party is) and have no way of getting back. But, they throw their own party and Quinn works her magic and finds a way to go back home.\", '2005-05-01', 23, 8.0, 1, '/htSBq0F4NWK5w1x13iRAG9pH0wi.jpg', None)"}
