{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:54.352709+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 50.72s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a7e10e432c62443498948723db976726', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107968, 1, 'Back to PCA', \"It's the second semester at P.C.A. Dana left for the European Exchange Program so, Zoey and Nicole need a new roommate. When they come back to their  ... (150 characters truncated) ... ew roommate. Meanwhile, Michael and Chase have to deal with Logan, who goes completely overboard on the entertainment system for their new dorm room.\", '2005-09-11', 24, 0.0, 0, '/21D6rAd87j79NNATVW0lzpboPSj.jpg', None, '7c9d581b89b6416488cabb97cda185e9', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107969, 2, 'Time Capsule', 'Mr Bender decides to have each person in his class put an item that best represents them into a time capsule. Chase is desperate to know what Zoey ha ... (7 characters truncated) ... about him in the video she made to put in the time capsule, and will go to any lengths to find out. Also, Nicole tries to help Quinn to stop snoring.', '2005-09-18', 23, 0.0, 0, '/kCtbNd6RVlWoEdkLF3f575aABeg.jpg', None, '80666d11e9154377a69a515756589469', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107970, 3, 'The Election', \"It's election time again, class presidents have to be voted for and Chase and Zoey end up nominating each other. Then they make pact of whatever happens, they promise that the election won't affect their friendship. But then later on, things get spicy between them.\", '2005-10-09', 24, 0.0, 0, '/rNMdrlAXG8aGAsgfejpMYhHEYLX.jpg', None, '90627b3bac9c41a9bf620c7a915d9599', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107971, 4, 'Haunted House', 'Every Halloween at PCA, the secondary makes a haunted house for the lower school. This year, Logan is in charge. He promises everybody that the haunt ... (260 characters truncated) ... A by some French tourists who think he is ill, and Nicole gets a case of mistaken identity when she chases Mark. Lola did not appear in this episode.', '2005-10-30', 24, 0.0, 0, '/rCSBLYgDKLd4Pgp6UG9fqBl8bqW.jpg', None, '8b7748a982a84cf59a28e0983c3c7af7', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/hUqmqbyT01Lsdv0jKWXE4uzyzDd.jpg', None, '50fbaffd63fd4b65b283bc8221bb0fe7', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107977, 10, 'Spring Break-Up (1)', \"Zoey and the gang are going to Logan's beach house for Spring Break.  There they are testing Logan's father's new show called Gender Defenders. Meanwhile, Chase sends a text message by mistake to Zoey confessing his love for her.\", '2006-03-10', 24, 9.0, 1, '/jtk2b9l2ytWJq6PAgXDqOzlabvj.jpg', None, 'ca53ebad178a4c63b7e43f106afd2686', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107978, 11, 'Spring Break-Up (2)', \"Zoey and the gang are going to Logan's beach house for Spring Break.  There they are testing Logan's father's new show called Gender Defenders. Meanwhile, Chase sends a text message by mistake to Zoey confessing his love for her.\", '2006-04-09', 24, 0.0, 0, '/ArAVIvqYwqkzRbYN2vdUq474kjw.jpg', None, '7ebbaaf67a8c4c319f5f7618a566dbf1', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107981, 12, 'People Auction', 'After a fire burns down Sushi Rox, Zoey and the gang hold a people auction to raise money in order to rebuild it. Chase and Michael get auctioned to  ... (97 characters truncated) ... ey are told to \"cheer his awesomeness\", as in cheer for everything he does. His plan backfires when the girls decide to cheer for everything he does.', '2006-04-16', 24, 0.0, 0, '/1Es36qfQAyEkRGzBs4tD9gn1Hce.jpg', None, '906e21f2375e4c8484bce91582d6bd94', '617fa974b767471cb278a8a4135fc91d', 107979, 13, \"Quinn's Alpaca\", \"Quinn's pet alpaca, Otis, is depressed because he misses her, leaving her feeling depressed as well. The girls then decide to try and cheer her up by ... (274 characters truncated) ... ining the letter 'S' and the person who loses has to run across the campus wearing nothing but a bikini top, a hula skirt, and a flashing red helmet.\", '2006-04-16', 24, 0.0, 0, '/4VY0SGdAY3cDokBG35SW9Wyz2n0.jpg', None)"}
