{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:54.726031+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 51.09s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('7478ee7dba3d4935ad5a43c185d691ca', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107941, 1, 'Trading Places', 'Zoey returns to PCA, hoping to tell Chase how she feels about him, but her friends have shocking news to tell her: Chase has recently moved away from ... (292 characters truncated) ... e problems of having a long-distance relationship and decide to move on until Chase moves back to PCA so they can be together. Guest Star: Sean Flynn', '2008-01-27', 24, 0.0, 0, '/cVARYBaNIptKWPYOPld3ASJ0f06.jpg', None, '01998919e174475184352c607bcea626', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107942, 2, 'Fake Roommate', \"Michael and Logan try to fool the housing lady into making a fake Chase in order to avoid getting a new roommate. Zoey accidentally gets Coco fired a ... (157 characters truncated) ... es. So, Dean Rivers fires Mira and Coco is hired again, but she isn't seen at the end of the show. Before leaving, Mira also steals Dean Rivers' car.\", '2008-01-27', 24, 0.0, 0, '/5shJcBoUCrFnAmySXemhfuV2CRs.jpg', None, '4951feb4a3cc4644b524ddaa0aae1a71', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107943, 3, 'Alone at PCA', \"When the gangs' spring break trip to Yosemite National Park is canceled, they get to stay on PCA campus and have fun with no-one else around. However, Dean Rivers later accuses them of vandalism.\", '2008-02-03', 24, 0.0, 0, '/yUNw51dTsXxhhLI3SAmkvgL7TTe.jpg', None, '56bc8d4fe1094eeb9c49562e76c53ca2', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107944, 4, 'Rumor of Love', \"A new guy moves into Chase's room and catches Zoey's eye. Rumors begin to go around that Zoey has a crush on him.\", '2008-02-10', 24, 0.0, 0, '/kLdDcClDKY0nx8mqVovpYJFzaVJ.jpg', None, '0418fe12c41f4e33a054ce163c4ab9e3', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11' ... 68 parameters truncated ... '/6SHZaZuWnmnHX0TYj3bTDkixgDN.jpg', None, '0e2184a6ee7e46629435d3b63f3ccdeb', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107951, 11, 'Roller Coaster', \"Zoey's Physics teacher decides to take the class on a field trip to go on a roller coaster, and all the students are ecstatic, except for Michael. He's got a big problem, but will the gang be able to help him out, and will Lisa stand by his side?\", '2008-04-27', 24, 0.0, 0, '/3VpeIKkCwKKjRGk9TRoGXrO1kxy.jpg', None, 'f4f84b85e9464a83bfa01136765d2174', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107952, 12, 'Chasing Zoey (1)', \"The end of the school year is approaching, and that means Prom is too! Zoey is going to spend her summer in Maui, but when James offers to come along ... (185 characters truncated) ... at either of them expected. Meanwhile, Lola is made head of prom committee, and all she wants is to arrive fashionably late, but will she be able to?\", '2008-05-02', 24, 0.0, 0, '/7TREnsYZUzQiHo3UWLK6kIL2tPU.jpg', None, 'dc35c82b30b744f9a6c17cdf2f82c7e2', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107954, 13, 'Chasing Zoey (2)', 'Zoey 101: Chasing Zoey is a TV movie based on the Nickelodeon TV series, Zoey 101. It originally aired on May 2, 2008 and stars Jamie Lynn Spears as  ... (125 characters truncated) ...  before the series finale, \"PCA Confidential\". The movie had more than double of the series\\' average viewers when it drew about 7.3 million viewers.', '2008-05-02', 24, 0.0, 0, '/3OKtoG1pUX9duuc3guM9ZR0rJqQ.jpg', None, '72a524b49dda43b7b934009ba7f53f29', 'ed7c42988792408e94304891fb1e5c11', 107953, 14, 'PCA Confidential', 'Zoey, Chase, and Stacey take a walk down memory lane as prospective new students ask them about their experiences attending PCA. Stacey becomes upset ... (12 characters truncated) ...  asks her any questions. Questions for Zoey and Chase include queries about dating, science and technology, and dress codes, among many other things.', '2008-05-02', 24, 0.0, 0, '/x4qQinUzp31J3xOUrgGe4ncWekM.jpg', None)"}
