{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:55.012829+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 51.38s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('947bbb6607694491968a94bc8bdd6ef7', '836017c41ad44b4698560473a0e888b0', 1858840, 1, \"Peru's Sacred Valley\", \"Chef Gordon Ramsay travels by motorbike through Peru's Sacred Valley of the Incas to discover traditional high-altitude cuisine. Immersing himself in ... (96 characters truncated) ... ke fried worms, rare multicolored potatoes and guinea pig before putting his newfound skills to the test with legendary local chef Virgilio Martinez.\", '2019-07-21', 47, 8.0, 2, '/7doCG5ngGEBNwmZmX3HSguM2Gom.jpg', None, '3a817dea77374a23836cde5b7dc459f6', '836017c41ad44b4698560473a0e888b0', 1859204, 2, \"New Zealand's Rugged South\", 'Chef Gordon Ramsay journeys to the remote corners of southern New Zealand to unlock the secrets of traditional Maori cuisine. From the locals, he lea ... (67 characters truncated) ... ua shellfish and forages for unique Kiwi ingredients before putting his new skills to the test at a Maori feast with up-and-coming chef Monique Fiso.', '2019-07-28', 47, 7.0, 1, '/xTT3JPVbEUgXeosSMbNHHRz5Pw2.jpg', None, 'e71c5b9006514f84ad7f01ef7262256c', '836017c41ad44b4698560473a0e888b0', 1859205, 3, 'The Mountains of Morocco', 'Chef Gordon Ramsay travels to Morocco, North Africa, where he embarks on an adventure deep in the Middle Atlas Mountains to understand ancient Berber ... (108 characters truncated) ... experiences the life of the Berber people. He puts his new skills to the test, cooking a feast with chef Najat Kaanache to celebrate Berber New Year.', '2019-08-04', 47, 7.0, 1, '/thdcc4Zva7B5LHR3box87EhWnWx.jpg', None, '2bc5adadc399424c836bdf8580691e10', '836017c41ad44b4698560473a0e888b0', 1866252, 4, \"Hawaii's Hana Coast\", 'Chef Gordon Ramsay travels to Maui, Hawaii, to explore the exotic ingredients of Hawaiian cuisine. In torrential rain, he travels along the treachero ... (75 characters truncated) ... oduce Hawaiian taro and spearfish with legendary free diver Kimi Werner. Gordon tests his knowledge at a feast with top Hawaiian chef Sheldon Simeon.', '2019-08-11', 47, 10.0, 1, '/4uwrLxawdTtREKzEtwMZOAHX7iB.jpg', None, '5cd5c466516a41e4a0849da9ffb530e6', '836017c41ad44b4698560473a0e888b0', 1866253, 5, 'The Mighty Mekong of Laos', 'Chef Gordon Ramsay travels to Laos, where he takes on a rapid stretch of white water, kayaking down the Mekong in search of culinary inspiration. Lea ... (91 characters truncated) ... r ant, dives for freshwater snails and hunts for giant water bugs. Using his newly acquired skills, he cooks a banquet for monks at the local temple.', '2019-08-18', 47, 0.0, 0, '/qfm6JN7AL6XCKSNdFWCrqh20Yq3.jpg', None, 'dcd8c04628cc44089ecaca7683297647', '836017c41ad44b4698560473a0e888b0', 1866254, 6, \"Alaska's Panhandle\", 'Chef Gordon Ramsay journeys to the rugged Alaskan Panhandle to learn survival skills and discover Alaskan cuisine. On his adventure, he learns how to ... (56 characters truncated) ... ock face in a snowstorm and goes grouse hunting before putting his newfound knowledge to the test at a feast with legendary local chef Lionel Uddipa.', '2019-08-25', 47, 0.0, 0, '/ywgvO9fUP1N7TZ92HxJ5WDv23g5.jpg', None)"}
