Guyanese cuisine.', '2020-07-05', 44, 6.0, 1, '/7JtbCKfvoFlSBX15haAdLlZrbws.jpg', None, 'd62a354a476c43c4a1ea96484b76c57b', '8b6ae38b2ffb471c9ebfd9ae230b7420', 2317059, 6, 'India’s Spice Hub', 'In the spice capital of the world, Gordon learns to master the complex culinary layers of the region.', '2020-07-12', 44, 6.0, 1, '/qAOCMZc1DNFkt9blxveWhaNc8xx.jpg', None, '51da8b534264414a8ae46c064858e072', '8b6ae38b2ffb471c9ebfd9ae230b7420', 2317060, 7, \"Norway's Viking Country\", 'From herding reindeer to scuba diving in wintry waters, Gordon gets to the heart of traditional Norwegian cuisine and where it’s headed.', '2020-07-19', 44, 7.0, 1, '/pf0N56GppDtFwpd1M9EwPm91CjY.jpg', None)"}
