{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:13:55.291277+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 51.65s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('c0349d4c1b14455896aaacadc6b0a28f', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 2719610, 1, 'Texas Throwdown', 'Gordon Ramsay journeys to the wilds of south central Texas and meets some tough, gritty characters to learn what it means to be from the Lone Star State.', '2021-05-31', 42, 8.0, 1, '/4SAyPhoce3CGrFeBT87Q20dBFnu.jpg', None, 'a4e72e124e35496a80e966ba5b1e6c55', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 2719622, 2, 'Portugal', 'Gordon Ramsay explores the rugged landscape of Portugal, where the simple way of life is evident in the country’s incredible cuisine.', '2021-06-06', 42, 8.0, 1, '/hR6g3lA0nwynHRWBYjbg1e9CYn4.jpg', None, 'e1f94cb942204fd6b472f7c5cf515df1', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 2719623, 3, 'Maine', 'Gordon Ramsay discovers why Maine, United States, is called the “lobster capital of the world.”', '2021-06-13', 42, 8.0, 1, '/zBRxfUgyzmAHQ2dTyHC1PSjOY6f.jpg', None, '13ac62023fba4eabbf79f07d2cc3e001', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 2719624, 4, 'Croatia', 'Gordon Ramsay travels to the untouched peninsula of Istria, Croatia, for ingredients that rival the best of Italy in world-class quality.', '2021-06-20', 42, 8.0, 1, '/1dSGz05JRfnN0dCJnw4rYPR2riv.jpg', None, '61f6016a962249cdb6ee9d997767bab0', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/vThDL3SUHIwSHcGSNTpBnspgpmK.jpg', None, '4fe5f37a103f4faaa3c54eafaa6b56bf', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 2719629, 7, 'Incredible Iceland', 'Gordon Ramsay heads to the land of fire and ice during the Icelandic summer to learn secret cooking techniques utilizing the volcanic landscape. He f ... (165 characters truncated) ... ted shark and diving for scallops in the freezing fjords, he joins Iceland’s first Michelin-rated chef, Ragnar Eiríksson, for a feast in a rainstorm.', '2021-07-11', 42, 7.0, 1, '/afvFRy5iLhmcowcTMWoQxfvS31a.jpg', None, '657238d56db44182ba07114f97781d99', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 2719630, 8, 'Mexico', 'Gordon Ramsay discovers the culinary secrets of the country’s legendary Oaxaca region, where mole reigns supreme.', '2021-07-18', 42, 7.0, 1, '/8r6wHJsxUNKAJY2zRdPLMiY86rR.jpg', None, 'b0a65f7129f14b55af24b2f937ebc9fc', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 3027446, 9, \"Michigan's Yooper Cuisine\", 'Chef Ramsay travels over the Mackinac Bridge to the Upper Peninsula of Michigan, where he uncovers the culinary gems that originated from the miners.', '2021-07-25', 42, 7.0, 1, '/wero87Ow9jD4ZENU0HqwhbzGgCN.jpg', None, 'cab62208b6db4def8ad9ee0d309d665f', '261678811dc34da4b5e124eb179bf53f', 3027447, 10, 'Finland', 'Chef Ramsay explores the land of the midnight sun and the sprawling wetlands of Lapland in Northern Finland, at the height of summer to learn its culinary secrets', '2021-08-01', 42, 8.0, 1, '/tSVYTAD6TWTSJfogBsCQ63tm0pM.jpg', None)"}
