ome in Kettlecorn.\", '2010-07-23', 23, 0.0, 0, '/5YdJ2szySzsdXMTe62GUTuHHJsD.jpg', None, 'bf1ff46fa09b4996b145c49f311f170a', 'b91d434f091041be8d9bec63658439da' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/mPfXd67D7BubT95IT0tln3LyZsM.jpg', None, 'a1f114b6c69446b8b4f8ef79665af57c', 'b91d434f091041be8d9bec63658439da', 534428, 19, 'Twister (3)', \"The group starts rebuilding Kettlecorn after the tornado, but they continue to struggle to pay off the damage. As a result, London's father, Mr. Tipt ... (34 characters truncated) ... mself) to discuss aiding their monetary costs. Meanwhile, Zack, Woody, and Mr. Moseby attempt to sneak into Kettlecorn with a Search and Rescue team.\", '2011-01-16', 23, 0.0, 0, '/cHd7AaPbGZdKVfWngHsz6SSJiMp.jpg', None, '6890a38395304b589f75cd466f909f8d', 'b91d434f091041be8d9bec63658439da', 534429, 20, 'Snakes on a Boat', \"It's couples game night and the gang has a hard time finding a fun game everyone finds interesting. London tries to play a prank on Woody and it resu ... (37 characters truncated) ...  snakes. Meanwhile, Cody tries to prove he can be funny to Bailey and Zack tries to get forgiven by Maya when she learns how many girls he has dated.\", '2011-03-04', 23, 0.0, 0, '/gx9wedubxjJOnzEcJh3X2ht3zZw.jpg', None, '674e6a671412460a9dfb4f5af2d07af6', 'b91d434f091041be8d9bec63658439da', 534431, 21, 'Prom Night', 'After the students pull a prank on Mr. Moseby, he cancels the senior prom. So, Zack comes up with a plan to have a \"secret prom\". Meanwhile, Bailey t ... (32 characters truncated) ... r for prom queen while Cody helps Woody ask Addison to prom. Ultimately, the kids award the roles of king and queen to Mr. Moseby and Ms. Tutweiller.', '2011-03-18', 23, 0.0, 0, '/gpX6me8glOnUtZBgqBo1zmqoBZh.jpg', None, '788f2486e11141febf1e477bc50df1a2', 'b91d434f091041be8d9bec63658439da', 534430, 22, 'Graduation on Deck', \"Mr. Moseby announces that London's dad, Mr. Tipton is selling the ship and that it will be dismantled within a week.\", '2011-05-06', 