{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:07.066521+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 63.43s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a65bb129aa814b5c9959498d0d3bc721', '7b72d8493cb04de4ad7bbb14c00e990c', 390137, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Police chase a drug dealer down a motorway at night; a drunk driver risks his life in a bid to escape arrest; and one of Armed with outrageously fast ... (79 characters truncated) ... block in the fight against crime – and they are getting results fast. Essex’s most wanted car thieves leads the interceptors on a high-speed pursuit.', '2008-05-09', 45, 0.0, 0, '/yCPTFVMjURvz9koluQ0lRtoDkij.jpg', None, 'c2b78e4207b34ee89f412d51516d8310', '7b72d8493cb04de4ad7bbb14c00e990c', 390139, 2, 'Episode 2', 'After ramming one Evo, a criminal causes chaos by driving up a one-way street in the wrong direction. But this hapless hooligan is not prepared for the force’s secret weapon – Stinger.', '2008-05-16', 45, 0.0, 0, '/fpTQRYnS8ZDYwVpQqKVbkFuR7DB.jpg', None, '53d8aa343a5e497fafc35d1587f4b032', '7b72d8493cb04de4ad7bbb14c00e990c', 390138, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Armed with outrageously fast cars and the very latest kit, the police interceptors are the new kids on the block in the fight against crime – and the ... (81 characters truncated) ... dge technology and hand-picked, highly trained officers. Using Essex as a test bed, they have created the hardest-hitting police unit in the country.', '2008-05-23', 45, 0.0, 0, '/xGWUqXoNnnfyMyrTh6uJLHqrb96.jpg', None, '7137e7d57b47406896ce7686027a186a', '7b72d8493cb04de4ad7bbb14c00e990c', 390142, 4, 'Episode 4', 'In this instalment, police chase an escaped prisoner down a dual carriageway; a stolen van carves a chaotic course through suburban streets; and the  ... (35 characters truncated) ... for an armed robber.Elsewhere, the Air Support Unit harnesses its multi-million pound chopper to search for an armed robber in a late-night scramble.', '2008-05-30', 45, 0.0, 0, '/sNBX8raKL8B4GKpsnhhsKysZsgS.jpg', None, '277e83e6f30749e197cb412ecb05ae66', '7b72d8493cb04de4ad7bbb14c00e990c', 390140, 5, 'Episode 5', 'In this instalment, a criminal in a Lexus flees the interceptors but regrets his actions when his luxury car ends up a total wreck. Elsewhere, an Essex girl’s car grabs the cops’ attention; and one of the interceptors’ Mitsubishi Evos takes a battering.', '2008-06-06', 45, 0.0, 0, '/uLjrM8XPMqtJoM9llYic0a03cYB.jpg', None, 'beabd10505c143c3a02a27f741ba7ef0', '7b72d8493cb04de4ad7bbb14c00e990c', 390141, 6, 'Episode 6', 'In the final instalment, a BMW driver with a suspect package risks his life to escape the police; and the interceptors uncover the hideout of a gang of prolific robbers.', '2008-06-13', 45, 0.0, 0, '/c4ruiQlLt2PtFKJJEuc87YFggJr.jpg', None, '346709bb3390449094109dbf50a522bb', '7b72d8493cb04de4ad7bbb14c00e990c', 390143, 7, 'Episode 7', 'The final episode in the documentary series profiling the work of a high-speed police interception unit in Essex.', '2008-06-20', 45, 0.0, 0, '/xPbiLC5fBFLSPzyC7P0R4j2KJOW.jpg', None)"}
