{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:07.213768+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 383 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:07.213949+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 63.58s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('112cfddadcf54d19acec9fec94070021', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390144, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Technology and old-fashioned police legwork combine when the number plate on a drug dealer’s car flashes up a warning. What the dealer does next forc ... (103 characters truncated) ... to catch a couple of knife-wielding robbers in a stolen Toyota. And officers’ patience is sorely tested when a driver protests about a minor offence.', '2008-10-10', 45, 0.0, 0, '/idrhnwd8pAflpUCM1a4Y6WBXaa4.jpg', None, '85749a6b403145dd9563775b54c353c7', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390145, 2, 'Episode 2', \"A transit van tries to shake off the Interceptors in the back alleys of North East London, while another unit races deep into the countryside where a tractor's overturned and the driver's fighting for his life. The Air Support Unit's chopper uses its hi-tech kit to hunt a car thief in Southend.\", '2008-10-17', 45, 0.0, 0, '/nDQPmQlgFFPa00KCf1078Z2Msww.jpg', None, '0d81659162d140a08792cc375ad26fb7', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390146, 3, 'Episode 3', 'The interceptors embark on a high-speed chase when thieves steal a BMW. A drunk driver is detained and police must contend with a group of menacing teenagers.', '2008-10-24', 45, 0.0, 0, '/xA1gtg5ZgbVmyZjL27UDkJWvSqW.jpg', None, 'ad04f050beda48149ab56b46578c33ec', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390147, 4, 'Episode 4', 'With a population of 1.3 million people and a network of major motorways, Essex is a tough patch to police. The interceptor team is manned by 20 hand-picked officers who are specially trained to drive at high speeds.', '2008-10-31', 45, 0.0, 0, '/sxybeJ5YgklOhaSbTjgpymVVDMl.jpg', None, '2cd4f56c74bb41f2b7dd2aa4270aaff3', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620' ... 68 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'a06643f4bab04efebddc6066eeaa86de', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390154, 11, 'Episode 11', \"Essex's high-speed police interception unit chases the drivers of a stolen BMW X5, and the Stanway team gives two unsuspecting car thieves an early m ... (19 characters truncated) ... . Elsewhere, officers discover a vehicle that has been turned into a four-wheeled petrol bomb, and a road-tax evader encounters trouble with the law.\", '2009-03-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '73d65bb861be41119ae3abe6aa23002d', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390155, 12, 'Episode 12', 'The interceptors chase a stolen 4x4, give a couple of car thieves an early wake-up call and tackle a road-tax evader. In the second edition, Stanway Police are first on the scene of a bad car crash on a country road; and four cop cars pursue a speeding jeep down the M25.', '2009-03-06', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd1eb2285168440dc8f0dc4d4addc9632', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390156, 13, 'Episode 13', 'The interceptors tackle a dangerous felon brandishing a machete and a car thief in a 4x4. Elsewhere, the chief inspector unveils the latest weapon in the interceptors’ ongoing fight against crime.', '2009-03-13', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2df0ce56e22e48fb827d0cf75e2fb432', '5648a10d6d21461ab1ee915633073620', 390157, 14, 'Episode 14', 'This last episode offers a look back at the highlights of the series, including the unit’s efforts to catch a thief in a stolen 4x4 who tried to run  ... (1 characters truncated) ...  police Evo off the road. Elsewhere, officers have a trick up their sleeves when a speeding driver attempts to outrun nine cop cars and a helicopter.', '2009-03-20', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
