{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:07.367357+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 421 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:07.367445+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 63.73s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('be739771e37045a7bdb94be6227a21d8', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390166, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Officers pursue a fake ambulance and try and stop an out-of-control 4x4 as it is driven dangerously through the streets of Basildon.', '2010-06-07', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f278ed1ed74a487fa819bc28f3c4e25c', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390167, 2, 'Episode 2', 'In this week’s instalment, the Interceptors pursue a gang of thieves targeting plumbers’ merchants. And a fleeing vehicle drives the wrong way round a busy roundabout, resulting in a terrible crash.', '2010-06-14', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5015ce78e13a49558c909d0a9a9da37b', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390168, 3, 'Episode 3', 'The action-packed documentary series continues. In this instalment, four joyriders have a lucky escape from the wreckage of a Ford Mondeo, stolen property is found in the back of a vehicle, and the interceptors have to rush to stop a suicidal man from jumping on to the M25.', '2010-06-21', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9e551d237ebf4ca7a7d6ee93e83327a1', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390169, 4, 'Episode 4', 'The officers intercept a stolen car, foil a cannabis grower, engage in a series of drugs raids and calm a drunken sailor.', '2010-06-28', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1b5a8317536c4d3d9e427c1fa4b3a723', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb' ... 80 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'a9f7b4ebd5be4ad39ccf7443b72e653c', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390162, 12, 'Episode 12', 'Officers contend with riotous World Cup revellers, an offender who has breached his ASBO and a shifty suspected drug dealer. Elsewhere, the interceptors are forced to close the Dartford Crossing in order to halt a stolen vehicle.', '2010-08-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2cc048bbdeae405596dc17d102cefd80', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390163, 13, 'Episode 13', 'The cops are on the trail of a group of thieves who targeted a supermarket. A rude biker finds himself the subject of police attention, and a disqualified driver tries to evade the long arm of the law.', '2010-09-03', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f643f7f31e6344b785ae334061f8b523', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390164, 14, 'Episode 14', \"The chopper goes after an armed robber, Zippy the sniffer dog makes an interesting discovery and the team's new recruits are put to the test by a pair of suspected burglars.\", '2010-09-10', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5ba160a034b94a0aaca1826e425aa781', '78af1cff6c4c40b3a5e14a2271b9cfcb', 390165, 15, 'Episode 15', 'The team pulls over a very angry driver and the Air Support Unit has its work cut out pursuing an athletic burglar.', '2010-09-17', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
