{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:07.524056+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 63.89s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('47c8e898e5a24d378cba9f6b55179947', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390183, 1, 'Episode 1', 'A drunk driver leads the interceptors on a merry-go-round. The team joins forces with the chopper to track down a wanted criminal on a motorbike, and a young driver crashes straight into an unmarked police car.', '2011-06-13', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c8bf28913ef94be8bd2666d5477181dc', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390184, 2, 'Episode 2', 'The unit uses 20 cars and two helicopters in its pursuit of a reckless driver across two counties. Officers also discover more than expected when they track down a runaway motorcyclist, and a torrential downpour hampers the work of law enforcers at a traffic collision on the M1.', '2011-06-20', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1b0cc1c2806547828d0f93d5edbbbeb4', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390185, 3, 'Episode 3', 'The unit pursues an armed drink-driver through a graveyard, and a romantic night out is disrupted by an alcohol-fuelled brawl. Officers also give a lesson in road safety to a man who used his moped to transport more people than it was designed for.', '2011-06-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a97ca44f29ad4aa5a9201c24347bd1ca', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390186, 4, 'Episode 4', 'Officers track down a driver trying to outrun the law, and hatch a plan to apprehend a disqualified motorist. Elsewhere, a man makes a feeble effort to hide his identity from the police.', '2011-07-04', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'df92e84a4bb948babb6f37afc348dc6f', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28' ... 116 parameters truncated ... None, None, '71fdd9b2cf2b454aad15f5faeaf3373f', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390181, 15, 'Episode 15', \"A runaway suspect puts officer life in danger, Scott and Adam investigate the contents of a motorist's boot, and officers are called to a New Year's Eve pub brawl. Also five police vehicles are involved in a motorway chase.\", '2012-02-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fcf2404b147c4bac90db4108cf73a4eb', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390182, 16, 'Episode 16', 'Officers use GPS technology to track a pair of mobile-phone thieves, and a car crashes into a house over the Christmas period. Plus, Nick pursues a criminal gang. Also Jason contends with his own traffic nightmare.', '2012-05-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '60bc6a94b874482389496e1814069443', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390190, 17, 'Episode 17', 'Officers use GPS technology to track a pair of mobile-phone thieves, Jason searches for a hit-and-run driver after being called to a convenience store. Elsewhere, an uninsured driver tries to wriggle out of a fine.', '2012-07-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '306e74ac5fc24fa8a8b45c095f5afba8', '277f3ef7c9e94e1b9f0621e491dc7c28', 390191, 18, 'Episode 18', 'When a driver mysteriously passes out at the wheel, PC Nigel is first on the scene to help after passers-by raised the alarm. Meanwhile, in a city centre, there is a white knuckle pursuit through a busy street.', '2012-07-09', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
