{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:07.958625+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 64.32s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('ae55fd4207374589b96cd11e55495648', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955651, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Members of the operational support unit smash through a bedroom window in a drugs raid, a speeding driver is clocked at over 140mph, and friendships  ... (36 characters truncated) ... mines are found in a car. Plus, vehicle thieves try - and fail - to outpace the interceptors, and an officer gets help from a very unexpected source.', '2014-07-07', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '64fa5f6528b646e5959fda84278be543', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955652, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Mark gets lucky when a car thief crosses paths with him, there is a high-speed pursuit through Lincoln city centre, and a member of the public helps the interceptors track down a drunk driver. Elsewhere, Jon Peacock gets an unusual request and Jon Moon has an encounter with a surprising lawbreaker', '2014-07-14', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e1df77b99ede4d79ab17279ce4b14436', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955654, 3, 'Episode 3', 'The team carries out a raid that turns up a stash of drugs, a weapon and a large pile of cash, while Jon Peacock is amazed to encounter a half-naked  ... (186 characters truncated) ...  discover super-strength lager and drugs, and a speeding motorist comes out with a very middle-class excuse after being clocked travelling at 110mph.', '2014-07-21', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '837bf5f26c4744eeab837abe20b90cd0', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955655, 4, 'Episode 4', \"Dan Brigginshaw tracks down a driver who has given him the slip on the side roads of Spalding, while Suzie Ranyard comes to the rescue of a motorist  ... (73 characters truncated) ... most advanced kit to catch out a disqualified driver and officers are called out when a dead body is spotted in one of Lincolnshire's many waterways.\", '2014-07-28', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '29f82db8c2ed425a852fbdcc61a64db9', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566' ... 20 parameters truncated ... None, None, '5b7f66c26e8342818fbb4085aaaa9b0e', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955659, 7, 'Episode 7', 'Sgt Jon Moon and his police dog Kanto follow a trail of broken glass and spilt alcohol, leading to a confrontation with a robber wielding a nasty-loo ... (97 characters truncated) ... Barry Peach plays catch-up as a teenage driver tears up the streets of Skegness, and Jon Peacock detects a whiff of cannabis in a quiet rural village', '2014-08-18', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd12efd8e23bc4b739b958e114223a943', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955660, 8, 'Episode 8', \"Officers step in to deal with a rowdy reveller when things get out of hand on New Year's Eve in Lincoln city centre, while Suzie Ranyard catches out  ... (88 characters truncated) ... on arrests a shoplifter more than happy to admit to his crime and a young lad discovers how hard it is to pull the wool over the eyes of Jon Peacock.\", '2014-08-25', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fc9341719bdb41c9812cef2926084cb9', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955662, 9, 'Episode 9', \"Brian Conville gives a man a dressing-down for dangerous driving on the school run, and Barry Peach's detective skills come to the fore when he appre ... (62 characters truncated) ... e, during an initiative to clamp down on rural crime, officers from Lincolnshire's Roads Policing Unit find themselves pursuing some stolen tractors.\", '2014-09-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '948f7e2cc637423db9a6976537b9f763', 'ae29d50ae14241d79d7e0075bdecf566', 2955663, 10, 'Episode 10', 'Jon Moon and his dog Kanto are hot on the heels of some burglary suspects, while spot-checks by the unit on the A1 turn up a carrier bag full of cash ... (25 characters truncated) ... the scene of an accident where the driver was thrown clear of the car, only for another crash to take place - this time involving a line of vehicles.', '2014-09-11', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
