{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:08.122891+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 64.49s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('891730e077c34f8ea3d44dd0b160dc7a', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955665, 1, 'Episode 1', \"The return of the documentary following the work of officers from Lincolnshire's Roads Policing Unit and the force's dog section. Barry Peach outsmar ... (123 characters truncated) ... kes a jaw-dropping discovery when he pulls a car over in the early hours and Brian Conville gets mobbed when he deals with a reckless learner driver.\", '2015-02-09', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9c4d30955c844231958e5cf64e2c551b', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955666, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Barry hunts a lad wanted for assault, the police are hot on the tail of a suspected drug dealer and a drink driver tries everything to avoid giving a breath sample. Plus, Jon Peacock has a late-night encounter with two unusual lawbreakers.', '2015-02-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '494d2aadf7fe4a608dafc7979c518d55', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955668, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Dan Brigginshaw is kept on his toes when a suspect does a runner, a routine vehicle check turns into a drug bust for Suzie Ranyard, and Barry Peach h ... (28 characters truncated) ... up of Scottish revellers clash with bouncers in Skegness. Elsewhere, Jim Woolerton and Jason Baxter catch out a rookie rider who is breaking the law.', '2015-03-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '47d0b7e6b40f45afb996d24cefaba87b', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955674, 4, 'Episode 4', \"A foul-mouthed pensioner pushes Barry's patience to the limit, Sarah gives a bad-boy biker an early birthday present and Jim's Audi S3 is outclassed by a car 30 years its senior. Plus, Mike is left open-mouthed when he encounters a drink-driver who is three times over the limit.\", '2015-03-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '31a4387e3ee54fcea29308136a19fffc', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7' ... 20 parameters truncated ... None, None, '84356a20f3144160acf3cd95545e54e0', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955683, 7, 'Episode 7', 'Officers are forced to exercise caution when they stop an uninsured driver who is known to have a violent past, while Jon Peacock and police dog Brad ... (79 characters truncated) ... illegal, Mike Templeman pulls over a white van with rather too many faults and one unlucky driver discovers that there is no fooling Dan Brigginshaw.', '2015-04-06', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a0510e0c9b8a4be8a8adf72c6010e94f', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955684, 8, 'Episode 8', 'The hunt for a suspected burglar takes an unexpected turn, a late-night stop reveals a bag of drugs, Jon Peacock has a tussle with a fallen tree and Barry Peach deals with a case of some very hot dogs locked inside a car.', '2015-04-13', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1bc332e56fce433d95364260c9400a9b', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955687, 9, 'Episode 9', 'Dan is in hot pursuit of a two-wheeled tearaway, a drunk driver nearly causes a calamity, and Mark deals with a three-car collision.', '2015-04-15', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '5c5f72327fc44014a1fbf66b7439fe03', '77c42efc089747cead127727f5eb47f7', 2955689, 10, 'Episode 10', 'Dog handler Martyn finds himself in the firing line when he cops a tasty right hook, and Dan is given the runaround by an uninsured driver.', '2015-04-20', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
