{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:08.257967+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 269 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:08.258084+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 64.62s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bc58e78f5aab402a986919af28742e9a', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955694, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Interceptors Kev Salter and Steve Brant have their work cut out tackling a runaway stolen van, there’s a standoff between armed officers and a danger ... (19 characters truncated) ... Hamilton takes on a guy wielding a length of guttering when a roadside stop spirals out of control, and cops combine forces to round up a stolen 4x4.', '2015-09-14', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '05d3cbfe6f584bc9ba6bc588d66a1b32', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955695, 2, 'Episode 2', 'The high-speed police interception unit opens the door of a drug farm and assists with an emergency landing at Durham Tees Valley Airport. Plus, Jimmy Grieves catches a thief in the act and Darren Cawthorne deals with a driving who is kicking off.', '2015-09-21', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fb9f6f8a594c47a9960f3351fea8a6f5', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955698, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Kev Salter and Ian Squire hunt for a man roaming the late-night streets with a machete, while the driver of a Fiesta takes a pursuit off-road. Elsewh ... (54 characters truncated) ... r a spin with his mates, but leaves a trail of destruction in his wake, and a call comes in about a sharpshooter who is drunk and looking for a fight\", '2015-09-28', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'b83eecbe190a40ab97eede3610226760', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955699, 4, 'Episode 4', 'Damien Stevens draws his stun gun on an aggressive driver, while the hunt for a suspected armed robber turns up a nasty surprise for dog handler Jimmy Grieves. Paul Jackson grapples with a man armed with a machete, and officers get kitted up to raid the home of a suspected cannabis grower.', '2015-10-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8a85db483506407995247e1685d836a5', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275' ... 32 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'f3535e64f1564d9da12f192e95461700', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955703, 8, 'Episode 8', 'Kev and Steve go on the hunt for suspected heroin dealers, while dog handler Liam attends the scene of a suspected arson attack. Damo deals with a drunk driver, and another man is so inebriated behind the steering wheel that he blows three-and-a-half times over the limit.', '2015-11-09', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '79c1d5973cc44624af4add6c6dfda40f', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955704, 9, 'Episode 9', 'Justin Moffitt and Paul Faulkner chase down a gang of suspected car thieves, while it takes seven officers to stop a violent thief who tries to sink  ... (15 characters truncated) ... them. Elsewhere, a drug raid turns life-threatening, and dog-handler Jimmy Grieves tries to find out what has happened to a man with a bloodied face.', '2015-11-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '84cc436eedc142eb83b16a63428da141', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955705, 10, 'Under Attack', 'Special episode featuring footage of members of the unit coming under attack while trying to keep the bad guys off the streets, from axe-wielding criminals to thugs who are handy with their fists.', '2015-11-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c776d6ad50654b83af347fa68fea7045', '782c725ac4e74eb4baf836e627c3d275', 2955706, 11, 'Dog Squad Special', 'A special edition looking at the police dog teams in the Cleveland and Durham specialist operations unit. Cameras observe the highly trained animals  ... (133 characters truncated) ... awing on new stories as well as archive footage, this programme showcases the vital role the dog unit plays in collaring criminals within the region.', '2015-11-28', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
