{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:08.541898+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 64.9s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('25a717762504422e8b4a85a3420597b5', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 1220561, 1, 'Episode 1', \"The high-speed policing documentary series returns, following the officers of the Durham and Cleveland interception units as they tackle more law-bre ... (148 characters truncated) ... ossbow. Amanda discovers a consignment of crack on the A19, and Paul catches a bloodied, drunk driver trying to escape the law by hiding on a rooftop\", '2016-09-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '4fc6f2b252de4beb8afff42a2583f832', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 1222825, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Jacko leads the firearms squad against a man believed to own numerous weapons, a runaway rains roof tiles onto interceptors from the top of a building and a suspected car thief gives Dicko the slip before running straight into Paul.', '2016-09-12', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '475e5add50e4467ba4ab09ba6daf648c', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 1224746, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Kev and Pete are in a high-speed pursuit involving our fine feathered friends, Jimmy and his dog Boas have their hands full when a dangerous weapon is found early in the morning.', '2016-09-19', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a567d31069a44466b521da1139a9ab62', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 1224747, 4, 'Episode 4', 'Paul Jackson has his work cut out stopping a runaway van driver who is causing havoc, and a street disturbance leads Paul Faulker and Lee Wilson to stare down barrels of a shotgun.', '2016-09-26', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'b9b733ec122441948638cf773d80eed9', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'f707f10fb60841b7b69cfe540fa0562f', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 2895654, 10, 'Episode 10', 'Hoppsy goes after a disqualified motorist who hurdles two fences in his attempts to get away, Damo deploys a stinger in a bid to stop a drunk driver  ... (69 characters truncated) ...  deals with a drug driver with a mouthy girlfriend and Lee has a strange weekend involving a burning car, two inebriated men and a large garden gnome', '2016-11-07', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e594b9e12ae74ef38e8b4497f2b6d0da', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 2895655, 11, 'Drugs Bust', \"Ortis Deley follows officers from Cleveland and Durham's specialist unit as they embark on a series of operations targeting crimes connected to narco ... (192 characters truncated) ... d. Showcasing all the action of one eventful night, Ortis is in the thick of it as the interceptors ultimately seize more than £500,000 of contraband\", '2017-01-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7ff6bb642a70453db76dc03d2500102a', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 2895656, 12, 'Episode 12', 'A reckless car thief seems intent on causing carnage, while the pursuit of an unlicensed driver through a housing estate has grave consequences. Insp ... (87 characters truncated) ... in user takes a turn for the worse, and elsewhere officers face one of the biggest challenges of their careers when a stolen JCB goes on the rampage.', '2017-01-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd1ed4cc6fe904bdd9f2ea429e19c71a6', '971f6a35c32e40faa7eb365f74443749', 2895657, 13, 'Smash & Grab', 'Ortis Deley joins an elite team of police officers in Cheshire, as they embark on a dangerous drug raid. Rick Edwards follows officers as they embark ... (20 characters truncated) ... suit of a runaway driver. Plus, officers in Durham investigating a car theft ring discover where a huge collection of stolen vehicles has been stored', '2017-02-06', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
