{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:08.699387+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 65.06s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('973162ac48664d2b86ea9420a295464c', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1297142, 1, 'Episode 1', \"Tom tries to pull over a suspected petrol thief who is unwilling to stop, Mike corners a criminal in a text-book manoeuvre and Jim deals with someone who can't control his tongue or his bladder.\", '2017-03-20', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '3af1a1f6128c47cfa7dae9c62d9bac62', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1297143, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Gordo and Dan unleash their tasers to help arrest a knife-wielding teenager, and Jim leads five units to box in a car suspected of carrying drugs.', '2017-03-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '6aa9300139974719add1d767ed8d075c', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1297144, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Cases include a raid on a suspected drug users whose door won't budge, a chase after a souped-up hot hatch and a late-night reveler in Nantwich town centre.\", '2017-04-03', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ec8ea2914ae94ab4ab34e9e53eea49a5', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1299502, 4, 'Episode 4', \"The Interceptors come under attack from a gang of violent, armed robbers, and the boys in the 'Big Blue Van' respond to reports of bottles raining down on the streets.\", '2017-04-10', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd8abe18b02a04db19b99be6978297fae', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b' ... 44 parameters truncated ... None, None, '8beb190c5a9c48f4850f48b78d5d419b', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1317453, 9, 'Episode 9', 'Jim and the team take to the road to spring a trap on suspected drug dealers, while Dan and Gordy track down a man seen roaming the streets armed with two knives.', '2017-05-22', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9f6abcf8dd3040cd888f4e1f1fa259ee', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1323393, 10, 'Episode 10', 'Jenno and Bucko race to assist when Jim is rammed by a runaway driver, while Dan and Gordy have to resort to physical force on a drunk who is menacing a family. Armed officers descend in numbers following reports of a gun on the motorway, and a have-a-go hero helps to tackle a runaway drug driver.', '2017-06-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '24f08d67ed9548ddb268389b7f0d24ec', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1323394, 11, 'Episode 11', 'Dan and Gordy engage in the high-speed pursuit of a dangerous disqualified driver, and the hunt is on for a wanted man in a bobble hat.', '2017-06-12', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '82f2fcda5892406185c8e07b2ecceb77', 'c72859569b5340d3b72acd58ba540d0b', 1327282, 12, 'Episode 12', \"Sean uses the big red key to give a drug dealer a door knock he won't forget, and Jenno gets a face full of pepper spray.\", '2017-06-19', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
