{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:08.847012+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 65.21s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a342903cd0e64153957c34bd6a32df07', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1364283, 1, 'Family Matters', 'The return of the documentary following the work of high-speed police interception units, this time riding along with officers from the Durham, Cleve ... (234 characters truncated) ...  assist in tracking down a burglar, and solve the mystery of a young driver who claims to have been coerced into breaking the law by a family member.', '2017-09-11', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '9e120c258aaf4043a46f4e25f777d2fd', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1364285, 2, 'Pursuit and Youths', \"The interceptors' skills are put to the test as they go in hot pursuit of tearaway teens and reckless youths. Jacko is on the hunt for a wanted teenager after he disappears in a housing estate and the interceptors are also hot on the heels of a stolen silver Micra.\", '2017-09-18', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd770ce4489d84f7fac35d990ee7c2cc6', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1367346, 3, 'Hide and Seek', 'Jacko has to deal with a suspected drug dealer who seems to have found a novel way of hiding his stash, and Mark and Steve stop a suspicious man trying to hide his true identity. Meanwhile, after a high-speed pursuit, interceptor Liam hunts down a wanted teenager.', '2017-09-25', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e01f29ea00a643e98cea7dd2c55cc95b', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1431498, 4, 'Cops and Conflict', \"In Warrington, dog handler Mark Sheenan tracks down a suspect who is believed to be cultivating cannabis, but instead of coming quietly, the man deci ... (57 characters truncated) ... nnett rushes to assist a fellow officer who has stopped a group of lads in a car, while Paul `Jacko'Jackson chases a runaway in a high speed pursuit.\", '2017-10-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'afeb1c37b9624a18a949d3b00f7eb931', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8' ... 68 parameters truncated ... None, None, '6e2c888fd2d14cc18def3e407cd7ef5a', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1431505, 11, 'Episode 11', 'Jacko is hot on the heels of a speeding car that is crashing into vehicles and causing carnage, while officers raid a cannabis farm hidden behind the ... (14 characters truncated) ... abandoned restaurant. Spike and Richie run across fields in pursuit of a suspected drug dealer, while police dog Shadow sniffs out some stolen goods.', '2018-02-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'dc61d9cfe6ff42578bb5ae1cc6eb0fb0', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1431506, 12, 'Episode 12', 'Liam and police dog Titan take part in a full-scale manhunt, while Paul takes two drug dealers by surprise, and a man needs to be rescued from the River Wear. In Darlington, Damo finds a man unconscious after a punch-up and a suspicious driver tries to outfox the interceptors. Last in the series.', '2018-02-12', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8f8d6bbf60294b88aad2f943d4a43bc8', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1431507, 13, 'Episode 13', 'Jacko and the firearms unit flush out a suspect after finding a homemade gun, while a 999 call leads to a drug just for Liam, and dog handler Justin sniffs out the truth when a mum and son tell some porkies over who crashed a car.', '2018-02-22', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '19f702d49026406e9a1e9a6e195d511b', '2297e75857de459cb3da346428a624d8', 1461276, 14, 'Episode 14', 'Jacko and the firearms team are called to house where a suspect shotgun has been seen, after a short stand-off, the situation soon descends into something more sinister when the team discover what could be a home made bomb.', '2018-04-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
