{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:08.990240+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 65.35s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('905f4f1068734b669c3b6e9c1f551594', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1477904, 1, 'Episode 1', 'A reverse ramming sends Chris reaching for german shepherd Ronny, Lee is confronted by a particularly mouthy motorist, Liam arrests a man who denies carrying out a shocking attack, tasers are drawn after a van driver causes carnage.', '2018-04-30', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '96bd3372c9494e9283ebdc97ddf84ec8', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1479627, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Interceptor Spike takes the lead against a runaway car thief in one of the most challenging pursuits ever. Liam investigates a gang of suspected drug dealers. A  supposedly straightforward stop snowballs into a showdown with an aggressive youngster.', '2018-05-07', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '061884179c40455090d7b7ae319a6e2f', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1483413, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Paul `Jacko' Jackson is forced to draw his Taser, while dog handler Mo pursues two stolen cars through the streets of Middlesbrough. Steve runs after an uninsured driver who has ditched his car, and Halloween turns from fright night to fight night.\", '2018-05-14', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2b2fba1827b44802a0a0865edcf58f7d', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1487258, 4, 'Episode 4', \"Damo is involved in a high speed pursuit, but the driver manages to give him the slip. The interceptors' eye in the sky then spots five runners from a crashed car. Dog handler Mo is called to a mansion, and Jacko tackles an angry mob.\", '2018-05-21', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '0b094b0806494d1e8a38df84d77d6d75', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181' ... 56 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'af868e63b3b84facb28b952cccc52611', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1521614, 10, 'Episode 10', 'Chris and the team are in pursuit of a stolen Mazda M3, but the driver disappears into an industrial area and tracker dog Ronny tries to track down t ... (9 characters truncated) ... n. Meanwhile, a routine stop and search takes a dangerous turn for Jimmy, and Liam helps take down a banned driver who causes carnage at a red light.', '2018-07-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '02595f72e17d494a82d53ea98d285f2b', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1521615, 11, 'Episode 11', 'Jacko is tired on by a suspect with a gun, while it is a day and the beach for Spike as he hunts for a man on a quad bike with a gun. Liam and Lee arrest a drugged up likely lass who could give Pinocchio lessons in telling lies.', '2018-07-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '830ed5425d8d4304bf713e1616548abe', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1528716, 12, 'Episode 12', 'The interceptors make an early hour dash to catch a team of late night burglars and one of the suspects treats Liam to a full face of saliva. Jacko and Simon are in pursuit of a speeding driver who abandons the car and legs it.', '2018-07-30', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2f1d18d0429843a0b099e6296acae7b6', 'd8210e7df818439bb2d05f9b42a72181', 1603578, 13, 'Episode 13', \"For the first time, pursuit is filmed from the suspect's perspective. Plus Liam and stiffer dog Louis help uncover thousands in cash and a £1/2 million of class A drugs. Finally, a 999 call causes firearms officers to rush to Guisborough at 11pm.\", '2018-10-29', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
