{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:09.340468+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 65.7s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('57c1db0250e7482c8b6cc2163c050886', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1606106, 1, 'Episode 1', \"West Yorkshire is one of the UK's highest crime areas. With this proud region seeing it's criminal activity levels spiralling, the interceptors use every tool in their arsenal to deliver justice.\", '2018-11-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '415b82d3ccd74d658594fddafd821a19', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1611948, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Runaway drivers are convinced to stop by the threat of 50,000 volts, a suspected drink-driver resists arrest and receives a face full of incapacitating PAVA spray, a fresh-faced and uninsured motorist tries to pass himself off as his 52-year-old father.', '2018-11-12', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1320bca0497e43a481427ca1b4115e8c', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1615833, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Chris Spencer and the team chase a Golf GTI that is racing through the streets at three times the legal limit. Reports gunshots at a house party on a residential street lead to a full scale firearms operation.', '2018-11-19', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'b3d3cacef1704780820242b661b7bfb4', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1623202, 4, 'Episode 4', \"Dog handler Steve and the firearms team are involved in a dramatic doorstep showdown in which a man is alleged to have attacked someone with an axe a ... (73 characters truncated) ...  hitting a dog walker, while a tactical pursuit and containment collars a disqualified driver who tries to pull the wool over the interceptors' eyes.\", '2018-11-26', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'bc71ad9e059f4cfba7ded5d395ca00c5', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8' ... 20 parameters truncated ... None, None, '522ea4f598734eea9f0fb7a282be22cd', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1637870, 7, 'Episode 7', 'Steve responds to a burglary in progress, chasing a suspect through back gardens. Interceptors flood a housing estate searching for suspects involved in a shooting, and swoop on suspected shoplifters with a boot full of stolen booty.', '2018-12-17', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd30524c65fd54779b3698883b4805bbb', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1657295, 8, 'Episode 8', 'Interceptor Steve is involved in a dangerous high speed pursuit of a car stolen in a burglary. The fleeing driver ditches and runs, and the police chopper tries to keep him in their sights.', '2019-01-07', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8325dc3cfb5549ba936f3b7d1563fe72', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1662222, 9, 'Episode 9', 'Dog handler Duncan attends a midnight stand-off between armed officers and a man who has been seen carrying knives, Suggs pulls over a motorist who appears incapable of telling the truth, and Charlie is given the unenviable task of removing a Range Rover from a ditch after a crash.', '2019-01-14', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '76f313dc656d401483b12faf31e105db', '4e34d00c203749eebe0f38d9f9624fe8', 1670035, 10, 'Episode 10', 'The interceptors are in pursuit of a road works wrecker, a 17 year old robbery suspect, and a drink driver who does not understand the word blow. Dan is forced into a daylight pursuit of a Ford Focus with a shocking outcome.', '2019-01-21', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
