{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:09.600524+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 65.96s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('5bb89bfed5e54a3c823640b20012bf66', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1718666, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Eight police cars and the eye in the sky hunt down a high powered Porsche Cayenne that is causing carnage. Undertaking at high speeds and goading the interceptors, the driver even manages to take out several police cars.', '2019-03-11', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '144790cb49bc4b7db9929aff3664468b', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1736747, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Pursued by a helicopter and a team of armed response vehicles, two men armed with machetes and a sawn-off shotgun make a dramatic escape on a motorbi ... (7 characters truncated) ... nwhile, officers Clarkie and Nick take two dangerous boy racers off the road, and a high-speed pursuit of alleged burglars turns into a race on foot.', '2019-03-18', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '56a550eed29b4dcbaf6a15c6cebeb23b', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1736754, 3, 'Episode 3', 'A suspect assaults Steve with his car keys, Charlie and Paul pursue an Corsa that stole fuel and Chris and Sophie spot a bunny hopping learner driver who already has eight points on his provisional license.', '2019-03-25', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a955ca0f962c46768fa9a1fe09dcc9b1', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1736755, 4, 'Episode 4', \"Ben and Matt find themselves on a high speed pursuit which ends up on a road to nowhere, Kev and Spencer assist in a TPAC, while Carl and Wayne nearly become victims of a white man's dangerous driving.\", '2019-04-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'f22df9a4596c45ecaa5e1efaad1431ba', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609' ... 80 parameters truncated ... None, None, '61f660e0082e4e329231c5ca0e3e911a', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1799541, 12, 'Episode 12', \"Kev and Spenner are in pursuit of a driver who is so drunk that he can't even keep his car on the road and the chase ends with shocking results. Elsewhere, dog handler Tony comes across an unusual sight - a naked man stranded at the side of the road.\", '2019-06-03', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd0ebdd2d81b24514b836f5661b9df7cd', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1822514, 13, 'Episode 13', \"Dan and Tom have their hands full with a driver who is four times over the limit and still refuses to come quietly even when he's bundled into the ba ... (29 characters truncated) ... and Adie stop a carload of lads at five in the morning and the driver is over the limit, but it's what's down his trousers that is more of a concern.\", '2019-06-10', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '412df2bd4f754119941c4c18639e3d36', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1822515, 14, 'Episode 14', 'A gang of burglars breaks into a house and takes the keys to luxury cars. After the thieves flee in three stolen vehicles, multiple teams hunt them d ... (207 characters truncated) ... ond stolen Merc are apprehended by the chopper team, Ben and Warren go after the third vehicle - which they are stunned to witness burst into flames.', '2019-06-17', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '39a951a9e8364f32bf58d37e3cc3ff2e', '40108546d0e949c0a7d4ff3bde579609', 1822516, 15, 'Episode 15', \"Officers go in pursuit of a driver who is so drunk that he can't even keep his car on the road and the chase ends with shocking results. Elsewhere, d ... (4 characters truncated) ... andler Tony encounters a naked man stranded at the side of the road, and Sophie is forced to buy a treat for the entire team due to a rookie mistake.\", '2019-06-24', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
