{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:09.769565+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 66.13s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('fbbc08bd1d164a2c81c04714e9fc5334', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b', 1951062, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Dog handler Tony comes across a most unusual sight - a naked man at the side of the road.', '2019-10-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '825ce6721c914034ad0bbcfb9e46f711', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b', 1952770, 2, 'Episode 2', 'It takes a stinger operation to stop a dangerous driver who reverse-rammed the cops, but the interceptors are in for a surprise when they see who is behind the wheel. Plus a dad is caught drug-driving with his child in the car.', '2019-10-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '0f077f9d11d44d93a668d3f915aa6a62', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b', 1960537, 3, 'Episode 3', 'Duncan pursues a driver treating Wakefield city centre like his own personal racetrack.', '2019-10-30', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2e5bb70eaf894a2aa156ab7d23378b7c', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b', 1971970, 4, 'Episode 4', 'A runaway driver escapes the car while still on the move, leaving Kev to chase him down on foot.', '2019-11-06', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fd85125cbe594109900bf773510ab409', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b' ... 80 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'a601825d36524d18ba787ae32ef3429e', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b', 2219885, 12, 'Episode 12', \"Big H and Stef can't believe their luck when a pair of drug dealers park up right in front of their unmarked car.\", '2020-04-20', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ac98fcbf539741d3a72b9860f174674c', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b', 2253765, 13, 'Episode 13', 'In Bradford, a Golf is seen doing 90mph in a 30 zone.', '2020-04-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '01f3a04a37fa4b2db7822ec7970d6016', 'e9c129942ab34db3be99bcf29fe3489b', 2253769, 14, 'Episode 14', 'Officers pursue an out-of-control car that hurtles wildly over a major junction and crashes between two