{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:10.335209+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 66.7s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('02180e5de0b741b7b1cec77929d81ac1', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3321049, 1, 'Episode 1', \"A dangerous driver tears across the pavement and takes off towards Nottingham city centre, and the firearms team tackles reports of an illegal gun. Meanwhile, a disqualified driver with no insurance and a pocket full of cannabis slips off a motorbike yards away from Rob and Dan's police car.\", '2021-11-10', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c2160a7f608d4a17bd3dd14ff76d86c1', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3331105, 2, 'Episode 2', 'The knife crime team stops a driver with a boot containing a box full of cannabis, which leads to a search of his house where police also find a cannabis grow in the loft. Elsewhere, Rob and Dan are in the right place at the right time when a drunk driver crashes right behind them.', '2021-11-17', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '922843e773e643fd9ab902d5d57ebe0d', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3340873, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Peugeot driver tries to give interceptor Ky Kirk the slip around the bumpy backstreets of Nottingham, leading Ky to send out an SOS to colleagues Rob ... (65 characters truncated) ...  them on his phone and, when they stop him and his mate, they're clean, but the interceptors suspect they are at risk of child criminal exploitation.\", '2021-11-24', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7186721f71a64cae934da7243e0c0f62', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3350600, 4, 'Episode 4', 'A suspected stolen Mini is pursued in icy Nottingham, and after nearly hitting a man walking his dog, police have a familiar face in handcuffs once a ... (25 characters truncated) ... e Crime team have a couple of suspected drug users under observation, and after confronting one of them, he quickly manages to swallow some cannabis.', '2021-12-01', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '14aa1147723745d9be8a81cb6ea68761', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6' ... 80 parameters truncated ... None, None, '83a4e8539ba0496fb10962424408386e', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3687284, 12, 'Episode 12', None, '2022-05-04', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c46477e7ca4a41ccbe347a8fc0013004', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3701884, 13, 'Episode 13', 'The firearms squad kit up with body armour to approach a man suspected of having a loaded crossbow. Meanwhile, police dog Quantum tracks and detains a suspected shoplifter, before helping arrest a man wanted for assault.', '2022-05-11', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '12dbf6972ae2499d982e46ebadbc2acd', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3713505, 14, 'Episode 14', \"On a stormy night, the Interceptors get on the tail of a fast-moving Astra that's been reported stolen. Meanwhile, it's nearing the end of the nightshift for Moz and Kingo. They're called to investigate a cannabis farm in a residential street.\", '2022-05-18', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '2cbb8c0133974e6b9da23c6bb98f117f', 'c40890719d1e455b8aa1b7da59702bf6', 3726366, 15, 'Episode 15', None, '2022-05-25', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
