{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:10.479497+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "INSERT INTO episodes (id, season_id, tmdb_id, episode_number, title, overview, air_date, runtime, vote_average, vote_count, tmdb_still_path, local_still_path) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ? ... 231 characters truncated ... , ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?), (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?) RETURNING created_at, updated_at, id"}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:10.480023+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 66.84s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('db46692e01a2495e8ea5ea156ebc810f', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3783732, 1, 'Episode 1', \"Nottinghamshire's finest are back with a bang as the interceptors clash with a runaway driver in one of the most epic police pursuits ever caught on camera.\", '2022-06-22', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ab755d1e5e444bc78f1321fc00b937bb', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3812124, 2, 'Episode 2', 'High-speed police interception units from across the UK are on constant patrol to make sure the streets are safe for motorists and pedestrians alike.', '2022-06-29', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '824d02431ab643e99eee1baf1f0d6425', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3832466, 3, 'Episode 3', \"A VW driver proves a slippery customer, especially on wet roads, and even manages to evade the interceptors' stinger. Meanwhile, Ken and Joe spot a couple of lads razzing their motors around an industrial estate.\", '2022-07-20', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '09b7fcf42eba4178a2bd9bcb047348d5', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3842934, 4, 'Episode 4', None, '2022-07-27', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ac2bd75ed999419ea3ca99bd9f6d210c', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6' ... 20 parameters truncated ... None, None, '681baf13f5e44a9b835f491939f6dfdd', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3893979, 7, 'Episode 7', \"In this high-octane episode, several units get on the tail of a white van that's been gunning it around town at four times the speed limit.\", '2022-08-24', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'a5257fd27463477caf3f99aefa11284d', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3909927, 8, 'Episode 8', \"Dog handler Chris finds himself on the tail of a runaway Renault. The motor is flying and when it hurtles round a blind bend, Chris knows what's coming - the Renault rolls onto its roof.\", '2022-08-31', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '3a7e26ba0a6f4ace81ae69bd81a06889', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3922346, 9, 'Episode 9', \"Jim and Lewis check out reports of suspected lorry looters at a service station in Trowell, with police dog Morse and his canine comrade Reno coming  ... (86 characters truncated) ... another driver and threatened them with an axe, while the Knife Crime Team arrest a familiar face with a load of suspected cannabis in his mum's car.\", '2022-09-07', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '1801e59c83ed42f8b74c22f1a9eb0336', 'd74a6cfe2fda48f490d258c76e2320c6', 3936992, 10, 'Episode 10', 'The Knife Crime Team spot a suspicious pair exit a car at the traffic lights and split up.', '2022-09-21', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
