{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:10.675301+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 67.04s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('da221fe2070b495ca70f2db17369d55d', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4422255, 1, 'Episode 1', \"Chris finds himself on the tail of a runaway Renault Clio. When the motor hurtles round a blind bend, he knows what's coming - the Clio rolls, ending up on its roof.\", '2023-05-15', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'd5ac6d5f152243749b9fb4654b898f6f', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4443110, 2, 'Episode 2', 'Units mobilise to stop a 185-mph superbike. The last resort is for tactical contact between cop car and the motorbike but can advanced driver Paul Charlesworth pull it off?', '2023-05-22', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '3fe856092eaf4768ac0ca6e97d379293', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4461500, 3, 'Episode 3', 'The Road Crimes Team pursue a 4x4 connected to fuel theft, interceptors battle to stop a dangerous driver a stolen lorry, and firearms cops are forced to use their big red key.', '2023-05-29', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e2054dd4ea994f99a7a6d60a810ba1df', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4496499, 4, 'Episode 4', 'The search is on for a stolen high-performance motor reportedly being used by suspects armed with baseball bats. In addition, Phil faces an electric scooter standoff with an illegal rider.', '2023-06-05', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '6ccf8faa4aac48b2835862bce903ffc0', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f' ... 128 parameters truncated ... None, None, 'd7463b15bec6489ebc86391273c7a2ab', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4670519, 16, 'Episode 16', 'Interceptors Gav and Neil pursue a pair of vehicles believed to have been involved in a raid on a car hire firm. Rob and Spence deal with a man hellbent on spitting at them.', '2023-08-28', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '4b8e78625689434791f8debdd046df8a', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4694053, 17, 'Episode 17', 'A runaway car speeds through the Nottinghamshire countryside, a routine stop turns nasty, and an artist in a rush is clocked speeding at over 100mph.', '2023-09-04', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'b5594048b40b42678f63d2ab4ca7b0b3', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4708347, 18, 'Episode 18', 'Rich and Ash are after a potentially armed and dangerous man who is suspected of smashing up a property. Plus, Macca pursues a stolen Ford whose occupants leg it into a field in an attempt to escape.', '2023-09-11', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e477e1b48f8f4e50b830579b081c579a', 'da8f33ff9d3f4eab8afc761982c10d9f', 4730766, 19, 'Episode 19', 'Two men in a van leave a trail of destruction during a 60-mile pursuit through four counties. The runaways ram multiple police cars before forcing Jon and Jules into a barrier at 70 mph.', '2023-09-18', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
