{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:10.880366+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 67.24s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('edf482df17e54146be6156b95bc02f38', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5549940, 1, 'Episode 1', 'Interceptor Bertie tails a fail-to-stop driver doing over a tonne. The chase ends with the car flipped onto its roof.', '2024-09-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '90147c5e4f5e40238384364d0d4a45e2', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5582993, 2, 'Episode 2', 'A drink driver subjects Tarnia to a torrent of abuse - and saliva.', '2024-09-09', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '61c3f84a042f448b921c246e7868f26a', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5587490, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Interceptors attend a prison where a man's seen tossing suspicious parcels over the wall.\", '2024-09-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'cb91a5ae6bb0473796adfb38e2ac281d', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5600508, 4, 'Episode 4', \"Police nab a van with no insurance, MOT, or tax. To top it off, the driver's been banned.\", '2024-09-23', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '46298c3efd384f89b22b6f241fe29f5b', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563' ... 92 parameters truncated ... None, None, '697e34fad9e44183bbb41615b94d2227', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5789394, 13, 'Episode 13', 'When Interceptors chase a drug dealer, Macca bags him with £250k of cocaine; cops hunt a suspect on the run; chaos erupts in a city centre standoff; and the knife team nabs a cyclist.', '2024-11-25', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'ac85934fbe1044938b1c17f2cde8ff10', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5790350, 14, 'Episode 14', 'The firearms squad springs into action when a driver linked to guns rams Jim and Ben. Kingo chases a 160-mph bike, and Matt deals with a man demanding £88 to take a drug test.', '2024-12-02', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, '97fba5a51b794365962b3df50c0bab1a', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5810046, 15, 'Episode 15', \"A runaway driver is brought to heel with the help of that trusty bed of nails known as a stinger... unfortunately the stinger team also take out an Interceptor's tyre!\", '2024-12-09', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'b666d0b7c7f142d89e665cb73fd7533b', 'b8207969ff09471ba6222314347a4563', 5838671, 16, 'Episode 16', \"The Roads Police and Firearms Teams join forces to stop a driver making a 130mph getaway in a high-performance car. Op Revive go on a mission to clear up the county's wanted list.\", '2024-12-16', 45, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
