ess', 'Enjoiner Rue confides in Dusk about her distrust of Demerzel. Hober Mallow pulls a daring move. Day sets course for Terminus and the Foundation.', '2023-08-31', 61, 6.913, 46, '/6GYAXHmylEJY2K3Oeqgux7CO89J.jpg', None, '5651558066d44b8c90a60b1b16ffaaa0', 'be99f16de51a48369177eb15c22e7b7b', 4430706, 9, 'Long Ago, Not Far Away', \"Dusk and Enjoiner Rue learn Demerzel's origin and true purpose. Tellem's plans for Gaal take a dark turn. On Terminus, Day confronts Dr. Seldon.\", '2023-09-07', 62, 7.115, 52, '/TdUee5ZozmAkQYIW3vguNOLy5u.jpg', None, '8b7e4f8bbbe842db8e39f7da17201684', 'be99f16de51a48369177eb15c22e7b7b', 4430710, 10, 'Creation Myths', 'Gaal, Salvor, and Hari chart a new path forward on Ignis. Demerzel heads to Trantor, taking actions that will change Empire forever.', '2023-09-14', 54, 6.98, 51, '/rDBBUToa28804yhpI5A1Qlu0E6P.jpg', None)"}
