{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:11.983503+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 68.35s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a0b9c765ffe04429bbc4c21ee67b1f92', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215082, 1, 'A Song for the End of Everything', 'A mysterious new pirate with terrifying abilities—known as the Mule—catches the attention of the Foundation and Empire.', '2025-07-10', 52, 6.1, 41, '/9YXWjKj6SDCaE3SaWbyfjjrPJIt.jpg', None, '1d33348d18bf4299a7cc1a2f60178093', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215876, 2, 'Shadows in the Math', 'Gaal and Hari advance their plans on Ignis. Empire grapples with an unforeseen prediction. Pritcher enlists help to investigate the Mule.', '2025-07-17', 49, 5.1, 35, '/wJGsaCKAQYwSnD972hWsPKTn13W.jpg', None, 'ea8242d2adea4fabbccbdffcc1a78897', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215877, 3, 'When a Book Finds You', 'An unexpected alliance is formed. Pritcher, Bayta, and Toran come face-to-face with the Mule. Demerzel seeks spiritual guidance.', '2025-07-24', 51, 5.7, 37, '/1NAH40bTLHuAPNdpRK9TRdhFEsG.jpg', None, '442e472a1dca41a581fad60dc4e7dc0a', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215878, 4, 'The Stress of Her Regard', \"Demerzel struggles with the paradox of her programming. Pritcher's true loyalties are revealed. Day sets off on a quest for answers.\", '2025-07-31', 49, 5.8, 33, '/fwTUbKEki6eO6z6zIPkvrUbQpjd.jpg', None, 'e39808a630be40c7bf8fec258521cae3', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/vnGCFHmCWi4jimCF78mZpOsK2tb.jpg', None, '8dc9d4fb9fec4892bdc5545b484ac6ff', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215881, 7, \"Foundation's End\", 'Chaos and destruction rain down on New Terminus. Back on Trantor, Dusk and Quent unite to assess the state of the galaxy.', '2025-08-21', 60, 6.2, 37, '/ka66SFrROXRhnyJeMjBE5jZHGp8.jpg', None, 'ce246b32f3474dd69173dd1d341a48dd', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215882, 8, 'Skin in the Game', \"Gaal and the Second Foundation reckon with the fall of New Terminus. Day faces judgment on Mycogen. Dusk's ascension looms.\", '2025-08-28', 47, 6.1, 37, '/hBNYVvVkU1mMgJh5Do7ol8Ck4gi.jpg', None, 'c0c2114c7bed48aaabb7c4da55d0f22d', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215883, 9, 'The Paths That Choose Us', \"Gaal confronts the power of the Mule's conversions. Dusk resorts to drastic measures. Demerzel searches for clarity about the future.\", '2025-09-04', 47, 6.3, 37, '/6fmWveBPYdcAKxMT7tEGVZLvYJx.jpg', None, '34c3f4a387e74a3391f94e34d99ae2a6', 'b6fbdfe24aed47aabc97407f81230851', 6215884, 10, 'The Darkness', \"Gaal and the Second Foundation take the fight to the Mule as Empire's legacy suffers a catastrophic blow.\", '2025-09-11', 52, 7.1, 40, '/eFNDKhD0uNFH04yAXjVoNnyoWdR.jpg', None)"}
