s truncated) ...  have the humans return him to space. While Brandy schemes to call for her own rescue, Mr. Whiskers is having fun playing spaceman and thwarting her.', '2004-08-21', None, 0.0, 0, '/9Y5BoIZ5wDimPHcmN17sHr6OV6H.jpg', None, '2e5f3f0c615742c793a1f0fce93a8bef', 'f8cb14dfd34f4429acd171cc13a187c0' ... 392 parameters truncated ... '/l8lAMRMFCUXFqBBCG1zTycjCjV7.jpg', None, '1454b12ce4004246b31313dd4e12eadf', 'f8cb14dfd34f4429acd171cc13a187c0', 35167, 38, 'The Show Must Go Wrong', 'Brandy and Mr. Whiskers discover a camcorder set while Brandy is trying to send out S.O.S. messages in a bottle. Brandy decides to make a quick movie ... (116 characters truncated) ... tape. Brandy buys into the idea instantly and Mr. Whiskers gathers a film crew from the jungle denizens, but will the movie production go as planned?', '2005-07-29', None, 0.0, 0, '/jgKF2cBr5gPoljdvKbjyjpM60on.jpg', None, '394fe418d75e45718a90b4826acf0ea0', 'f8cb14dfd34f4429acd171cc13a187c0', 35168, 39, 'Whiskers the Great', \"Mr. Whiskers has been depressed because he has been unlucky recently so Brandy decides to give him a simple task to boost his self-confidence, in whi ... (96 characters truncated) ... is proclaimed the Great Grooter by a pack of wild rodents which increase Mr. Whiskers' confidence, though is it in the manner that Brandy wished for?\", '2005-07-29', None, 0.0, 0, '/msf6BBinZxGzYoixKLUnsNSanQS.jpg', None, 'bbe6119621f34e399be353674552de8e', 'f8cb14dfd34f4429acd171cc13a187c0', 35169, 40, 'Freaky Tuesday', \"Brandy is attempting to teach Lola Boa how to give a pedicure while Mr. Whiskers is attempting to become a one bunny orchestra. However, their two go ... (267 characters truncated) ... y when the two return to their home, things take an unexpected turn as all of Brandy's friends begin to believe that Mr. Whiskers is the real Brandy.\", '2005-08-12', None, 0.0, 0, '/j0TouJ0EfuoXZibqfg4HShT6JRu.jpg', None, '90496467d5b7405a86a82d277758d6df', 'f8cb14dfd34f4429acd171cc13a187c0', 3