than Mr. Whiskers, she does what she can to forge him into the perfect boyfriend, though will she be capable of such a feat?', '2006-02-10', None, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fa7b3168a13942828fa0899c1b824f90', '6d77d59d1ce4433b904972abc3c010eb' ... 332 parameters truncated ... None, None, '335bc6df42f64b0191e3bb68ba02ea3c', '6d77d59d1ce4433b904972abc3c010eb', 35202, 33, \"Big Girls Don't Body Slam\", \"When Whiskers decides to join Gaspar's wrestling league, he makes Brandy his tag team partner. However, Brandy soon proves to be an excellent wrestler and she adapts the alias of Sammy Crushington.\", '2006-07-21', None, 0.0, 0, None, None, '7cc4258cec8a4816a8881c2b1b449579', '6d77d59d1ce4433b904972abc3c010eb', 35203, 34, 'I Am Rainfo', 'Mr. Whiskers finds a book about the Amazon Rain forest, though what he discovers scares him. He decides to steal the lifeboat roof from the tree house and sets off to live in the ocean, though will he succeed in his endeavors?', '2006-07-21', None, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'fe0e9ec9a8044e3295c1486f44ab8729', '6d77d59d1ce4433b904972abc3c010eb', 35204, 35, 'The Tortoise And The Hare-Brain', 'After being mocked by tortoises, Whiskers decides its high time to challenge the tortoises to a match to tend the tortoise and the hare story end.', '2006-08-25', None, 0.0, 0, None, None, '8ff6381c9d074639b53f33df84415862', '6d77d59d1ce4433b904972abc3c010eb', 35205, 36, 'Rip Van Whiskers', 'After Whiskers thinks he has been bitten by a frog that can make victims sleep for 50 years and decides to do a lot of things with Brandy including \"kiss a preety girl\". When Brandy finds out she\\'s the girl to kiss, and the frog that Whiskers had been bitten by has to convince Whiskers the truth.', '2006-08-25', None, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
