21, '/bOjLyaf1CFrMNQG5EN22yKc3U2s.jpg', None, 'd774bbb389b94b5fb8be07ac2bfcafa4', '03d8660603e742bfb959783faa042fd3' ... 140 parameters truncated ... '/ulAq86H8sdSl3ZdZjtmRajspLRO.jpg', None, 'd0140458374d4cecac0d27f83960505c', '03d8660603e742bfb959783faa042fd3', 2175127, 17, 'Fixation', 'A patient with a mysterious and undiagnosed illness that has baffled other doctors for years forces Shaun and the team to take some big risks. Claire and Melendez continue to cautiously navigate their feelings for each other as colleagues and friends.', '2020-03-02', 43, 8.1, 20, '/fYH8ki5p0JXGzLab06cNNe4S08n.jpg', None, 'c1eff5e4747f49b993e2498e7f242162', '03d8660603e742bfb959783faa042fd3', 2175128, 18, 'Heartbreak', 'Claire and Shaun treat a patient with a rare form of dwarfism. Reznick, Lim and Park treat a young man who had both arms torn off in a previous farming accident. Shaun reacts to an emotional situation.', '2020-03-09', 43, 8.474, 19, '/ujSK9Y2Jp2SLc5LULkCJInCMRJl.jpg', None, '1d02e6c47e0a420e9eb2a3f0cf73d6b9', '03d8660603e742bfb959783faa042fd3', 2185969, 19, 'Hurt (1)', 'The city of San Jose is rocked by a massive earthquake that puts the staff of St. Bonaventure Hospital on high alert as they race to assess the damag ... (45 characters truncated) ... ues and friends. Meanwhile, Dr. Neil Melendez and Dr. Aaron Glassman are attending a charity event when their lives are threatened by the earthquake.', '2020-03-23', 43, 8.579, 19, '/5IIUBAcngWNFxNb813Lms0CZ65Q.jpg', None, 'c636227789004bb6924d0b42963b79ef', '03d8660603e742bfb959783faa042fd3', 2185970, 20, 'I Love You (2)', 'The staff of St. Bonaventure Hospital works against time and their own personal safety to save the lives of those around them.', '2020-03-30', 43, 8.737, 19, '/bbV4bHdzLZ7jp3z9aWvVLFPSAAu.jpg', None)"}
