{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:16.838949+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 73.2s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e781b93c2c9c4738827f6604912f8dda', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2432756, 1, 'Frontline (1)', \"Dr. Murphy treats a patient who has an illness that is not only unpredictable in nature, but also unlike anything he or the team has seen before. Dr. Claire Brown continues to work through her grief, still reeling from Dr. Neil Melendez's death.\", '2020-11-02', 43, 7.417, 24, '/bUq4aNotfqlrZ2galZ6aWoE75pI.jpg', None, '30df3e7e7f524b74a5cff4cfd95518d0', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2451542, 2, 'Frontline (2)', \"Shaun has a hard time balancing his fears and concerns about potentially jeopardizing Lea's health and wanting to be with the woman he loves. Claire looks for a way to grieve Melendez's death. Park and Mia discuss their future together.\", '2020-11-09', 43, 8.0, 21, '/oncm0Ae5dOAyjkseCZ8mPEh1Ejp.jpg', None, '37dc798f868f41be9e3b6e1f76ada876', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2451543, 3, 'Newbies', 'With several candidates vying for residency at St. Bonaventure, Chief of Surgery Dr. Audrey Lim tasks Dr. Shaun Murphy, Dr. Claire Browne and Dr. Ale ... (225 characters truncated) ...  Lea while discussing the pros and cons of the controversial surgery. And elsewhere, Dr. Morgan Reznick seeks out Claire and Lim’s help on a consult.', '2020-11-16', 43, 7.611, 18, '/4ic5zBy0YQqxFKsby6uZaoepnFl.jpg', None, 'ea027036564441d09305afd8af21cf2e', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2519381, 4, 'Not the Same', \"Dr. Morgan Reznik and Dr. Shaun Murphy's pregnant patient with twins is having pain and they are forced to grapple with a decision no one wants to make. Meanwhile, Shaun asks Lea to move back in despite her reservations\", '2020-11-23', 43, 7.824, 17, '/bupCPJ08QBV0GsRwZOvFLga6G1d.jpg', None, '1632f4c6219e4616be9ba1357e1993f1', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6' ... 140 parameters truncated ... '/1HbbdnnxnalxWJ70NQLOwREu8oX.jpg', None, 'e5aaec8e4af14d409d12c7509b25c13a', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2909603, 17, 'Letting Go', \"Dr. Claire Brown and the team must face hard truths about what lines they are willing to cross when one of Claire's idols becomes her patient.\", '2021-05-17', 43, 7.882, 17, '/AdO7hgfzEMScfWokzIUfljn1KDV.jpg', None, '980b9d0101234ee0b9fda2b1fd155278', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2944091, 18, 'Forgive or Forget', 'Shaun and Lea go on a camping trip to distract themselves from their grief over their miscarriage. Meanwhile, Morgan and Park argue about the best course of treatment for their patient.', '2021-05-24', 43, 7.824, 17, '/mZ2fazdYSCUeyNZrIMYZwBq7szt.jpg', None, 'eccd47931fa84357862c0c59c27ea741', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2944094, 19, 'Venga (1)', 'The St. Bonaventure team travels to Guatemala on a surgical mission to help patients at a rural hospital. Once there, the team faces a small communit ... (68 characters truncated) ... ing task of identifying who they can help most. And while Shaun seems to be thriving in Guatemala, Lea is still struggling with the loss of her baby.', '2021-05-31', 43, 8.353, 17, '/mFkj1IyjFDhFmbUFnkmijrE4dK8.jpg', None, '86e45afcd3eb476db9d96aed98172ccc', '94f0aed2b0fe4dc5a920e19ca81b31a6', 2944095, 20, 'Vamos (2)', 'Dr. Shaun Murphy must perform a risky surgery on a patient without electricity when the power suddenly goes out. Meanwhile Lim and Dr. Mateo Rendón Osma’s relationship deepens as they overcome difficulties during the surgery.', '2021-06-07', 43, 8.579, 19, '/m1Wq6KKMOEGfcM643U90uhEM3Du.jpg', None)"}
