{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:16.994781+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 73.36s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e42de5eabb61499a8e577b6c4cb0ee4d', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3076759, 1, 'New Beginnings', \"Shaun and Lea's upcoming engagement party has everyone in a festive mood; a young single mother learns her son may have contracted his cancer from a surprising source; Mateo finds out if his previous issues in America will be resolved.\", '2021-09-27', 43, 8.053, 19, '/mbqxKWKibdywlUHOF5Kwl7zCnvU.jpg', None, '0dd1a72cdaba43fab06933e381267408', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3148084, 2, 'Piece of Cake', \"Dr. Shaun Murphy and the team race to save a pregnant woman's baby and find her current situation as a convicted felon complicates it even more than they realize. Meanwhile, the hospital takes on some unexpected changes that the staff are not prepared for.\", '2021-10-04', 43, 7.882, 17, '/rrjFDXsMSHveoU3fZzOIT5U2UCh.jpg', None, 'b36aba9891a64f7d83576879867f01ec', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3148085, 3, 'Measure of Intelligence', 'Shaun confronts Salen about the many changes she has implemented since coming on at St. Bonaventure. Glassman is forced to accept his new role at the hospital.', '2021-10-11', 43, 8.188, 16, '/ZidBfB6L7tyr21EQ811X3EcXZV.jpg', None, 'dab2ec591fba4206965596d1ab46d5b4', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3148086, 4, 'Rationality', 'Dr. Shaun Murphy and the team treat a young girl whose father’s personal research complicates their treatment plans. Meanwhile, Dr. Park, Dr. Reznick and Dr. Lim’s patient refuses a life-saving lung transplant despite having a family donor.', '2021-10-25', 43, 8.313, 16, '/812UcjxVcNmnhbk29PmTJqxrHPy.jpg', None, '9e8fd7e1a9e44bd8b5688f80c29f90c8', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca' ... 116 parameters truncated ... '/p1z3JIutHsdzU5BaxDMT2BNdkNY.jpg', None, '2f0c217c1a9741a8bf91779100d0c0fd', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3636951, 15, 'My Way', \"While Doctor Andrews treats a foster kid for injuries sustained at his group home, Shaun and team look to Lea's expertise with cars and auto repair to help a patient whose iron lung has broken. Meanwhile, the patient's niece, a documentarian, takes an interest in Shaun.\", '2022-04-18', 43, 8.154, 13, '/zv5Ml7kb0qVBb3DHibUZ2moKiRy.jpg', None, '72c7b06f25f142629eca6c0e7e0d0608', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3671354, 16, 'The Shaun Show', 'As Shaun and Lea head toward their wedding day, a documentary film maker has chosen to follow their lives to showcase relationships and weddings of atypical couples.', '2022-05-02', 43, 8.231, 13, '/bmQKaY0ZWdornKE60YBPvJ8J7Tg.jpg', None, '2775b05f7834473bb49a49732f26c795', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3671355, 17, 'The Lea Show', \"Sophie takes Lea out for a day full of luxurious wedding planning. And after a near fatal oversight, Dr. Lim senses an underlying issue is behind nurse Villanueva's unprofessional behavior.\", '2022-05-09', 43, 8.571, 14, '/11wk33AZRjfZjPsP3Sdxwf0tgo1.jpg', None, 'a9a89c74b52e4480a56ef39c8a9bf0c6', '86281c52511e47f89c0667099f55baca', 3671356, 18, 'Sons', \"Shaun and Lea make a big life decision and are pleasantly surprised by the support they receive from their friends at the hospital. Meanwhile, when Dr. Wolke's parents show up with a revelation, Asher struggles to accept that he and his father may never truly understand one another.\", '2022-05-16', 43, 8.5, 16, '/wSXFfKqM00CZFpBVrADDU2tEMef.jpg', None)"}
