{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:17.157045+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 73.52s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bb08513696554d7a9103ca9daeb9555b', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 3789581, 1, 'Afterparty', 'Shaun and Lea’s long-awaited wedding reception is interrupted by a violent attack at the hospital and the entire team must mobilize to save the victims. Meanwhile, the trauma of seeing people he cares for in life-threatening situations is affecting Shaun in more ways than one.', '2022-10-03', 43, 8.733, 15, '/jiwfFwM6DyEGMsq86n6WotqEML3.jpg', None, 'd7a5c9cc78754803abe2ee8728556a0c', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 3919235, 2, 'Change of Perspective', 'On their first day as surgical attendings, Dr. Shaun Murphy and Dr. Alex Park are introduced to the first year residents they will be overseeing, Dr. ... (25 characters truncated) ... niel Perez,who make quite the first impression. Meanwhile, Lim returns to work while facing her new reality and the emotions surrounding the changes.', '2022-10-10', 43, 8.267, 15, '/tVtGgTvlpk0uOBFU3zpSdtFjn6Q.jpg', None, 'b04f0e6717274ad3aa1c72b1fe2e9d05', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 3919237, 3, 'A Big Sign', 'The team treats a famous marriage counselor after she injures her ankle from falling, but when she offers relationship advice to them, Dr. Morgan Rez ... (100 characters truncated) ... r. Audrey Lim is determined to get to the bottom of what really happened in the OR during her surgery and sets off on her own internal investigation.', '2022-10-17', 44, 8.0, 14, '/roCnOVshIkgrOdpJpk7FX2wPyDa.jpg', None, '1c6179ac684747c499cfe2b8c9d1723c', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 4010681, 4, 'Shrapnel', 'The team operates on a military reenactor whose attempt at authenticity has created an explosive predicament that even Dr. Shaun Murphy couldn’t predict. Meanwhile, Dr. Jordan Allen and Dr. Daniel Perez are on a race against time as they search for a severed foot.', '2022-10-24', 42, 8.333, 15, '/r3Rb5iWs0lZJICZhYSJNevuoO2j.jpg', None, 'dd6d4c4236d14bf99094e43e3dd15db0', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/4Iiby3IdZOKdzhRgIqvOUHeyaOT.jpg', None, 'b08af39259d14caab04fa374c7795c33', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 4325233, 19, 'Half Measures', 'Drs. Andrews and Lim clash over a patient split nearly in half, which also reveals her issues with Dr. Kalu’s return. Meanwhile, Dr. Glassman gives Dr. Murphy some fatherly advice as they await news about Glassman’s recent tests.', '2023-04-10', 43, 8.545, 11, '/kRGCgXsdUnPn8SKJWzRsBdchjHZ.jpg', None, 'a347b19559ae4dac9ebc76c2e4b2e9d0', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 4325234, 20, 'Blessed', 'Dr. Marcus Andrews introduces some of the team to a patient whose optimism and faith seems to cause Dr. Asher Wolke the most skepticism in light of his own relationship with religion.', '2023-04-17', 43, 8.667, 12, '/e1M5FZrfir7fJsAqt3wi3sCTDGw.jpg', None, '362e02c1c6ca450097c7787cf6944953', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 4325235, 21, 'A Beautiful Day', \"Dr. Glassman and Dr. Murphy's relationship may be irreparably damaged following a tense moment during surgery. While Dr. Reznick struggles during her parental leave, Dr. Park may just be the one she needs the most.\", '2023-04-24', 43, 8.4, 10, '/qkLddujNxwsxYz9chhnU7mqWFGZ.jpg', None, 'e5929b54903a49dd81d3428828921521', '56950e1759d5413887d4118e1c6f76fb', 4325236, 22, \"Love's Labor\", 'Shaun and Lea are heading to the delivery room and everyone from the hospital is also there, except for one very important person. Meanwhile, a tragic accident involving Drs. Perez and Kalu pulls everyone away, including Dr. Murphy.', '2023-05-01', 43, 8.909, 11, '/kFG84C5AmvenUzkL2pX6m0lh3Ke.jpg', None)"}
