{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:17.761535+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 74.12s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('a73baf72cb8e4887b5462b9ddb446834', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171260, 1, 'Crush', \"Kim tries to get the confidence to take a boy to an upcoming dance at her school, while Kim's archenemy, Drakken begins his next destructive plan.\", '2002-06-07', 22, 7.0, 8, '/uSyWkqkmlk5YzTu4dq4ctEhlx9K.jpg', None, '701bc50cd5df4212ae30122bd708cb8a', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171261, 2, 'Sink or Swim', 'On their way to a cheer competition, Ron and the cheersquad get stranded, but Ron soon realizes that the whole thing could be a set up from an old enemy.', '2002-06-07', 22, 7.0, 7, '/pmHQgxgx6oaYzaFvgX6KayKTDW7.jpg', None, '3d05601153074507b769d4a29c2fd185', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171262, 3, 'The New Ron', 'Kim accidently turns Ron into a selfish jerk with a new haircut, all while two  new villians begin their new evil hobby.', '2002-06-07', 22, 7.1, 7, '/sPOKheqW0jsbvmon35loCHR7oOm.jpg', None, '32d32622f7e543ea874013db7f065bcb', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171263, 4, 'Tick-Tick-Tick', 'When Kim is tardy when going to class, she is sentenced to detention. Meanwhile, Drakken and Shego start their next evil plan.', '2002-06-14', 22, 7.1, 7, '/fn9wuXIuqutrUBOnZfwotThHgDi.jpg', None, 'a541cd949fa1403cbff707dea8820aa3', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187' ... 152 parameters truncated ... '/irQfrP5rWaVyMQmsAFw27fb1Pn4.jpg', None, '882a0025b78c40699b5e43897cf26ed0', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171275, 18, 'Animal Attraction', 'When Animology sweeps over the school, Kim tries to avoid it, but she gives into the fad. Meanwhile, the Seniors start their most dangerous plot to date.', '2003-01-10', 22, 6.7, 7, '/jUusmbUsM2vier7M41gc5YSSKi2.jpg', None, 'c07a2e673b8248129530e2ac4cc37591', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171278, 19, 'Monkey Ninjas in Space', 'Kim is forced by her dad to join a club for small children that he leads, much to her dismay. Meanwhile, Monkey Fist plans to steal a very special monkey to fulfill a prophecy.', '2003-03-07', 22, 7.2, 6, '/uKgsgVkp9MgZ92o33FdGqf3nyqx.jpg', None, '3d3fa398d6a240fa81772a8dc2e9b07b', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171279, 20, 'Ron the Man', 'Ron realizes that he is not technically a man yet, but Kim tells him that he is. Meanwhile, Kim and Ron must stop a villian from stealing a special ring.', '2003-04-25', 22, 7.2, 6, '/hyyt8KeQkUnn2NpAmq5eoCvDJcZ.jpg', None, 'bd749fb09b664812bc5dc31a08b7e378', 'c0caac017cab401499d7cc0a0d6e5187', 171276, 21, 'Low Budget', 'Kim ruins her clothes during a mission, and now must buy from Smarty Mart. Meanwhile, Frugal Lucre attempts to take over the internet.', '2003-05-16', 22, 7.0, 6, '/7ncHgZBsJwIcsXP15nqQh5mbKj6.jpg', None)"}
