{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:17.936120+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 74.3s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('bc7278bf89a54e449486c2c77a813d6d', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171214, 1, 'Naked Genius', 'Drakken kidnaps Ron when he believes he is a super genius because Ron’s schoolwork has recently been completed by a brain ray-enhanced Rufus; while Dr. Drakken attempts to figure out the source of Ron’s knowledge, it’s up to Kim and Rufus to help rescue him and foil Drakken’s scheme.', '2003-07-18', 22, 6.5, 6, '/bxRmjZX39y2B96Ml7gmEzQ5wRaK.jpg', None, '20c295c353674a90b0a854c0637e34b5', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171231, 2, 'Grudge Match', 'Ron goes to ridiculous lengths to grab the attention of a pretty girl at the theater. Meanwhile Kim uncovers a conspiracy at the Space Center involvi ... (50 characters truncated) ... gruntled former employee. In the process of solving the mystery, she is suspicious of the idea of a seemingly innocent being the culprit responsible.', '2003-07-25', 22, 7.0, 5, '/4l5n2gOfPRq05mkBtikvDUGokdo.jpg', None, '4cb46d52dd4a4167846aa9f7c0f56a02', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171215, 3, 'Two to Tutor', 'When Señor Senior Sr. becomes disappointed in the way his son’s villainy is handled, he decides to hire a tutor to ensure his son’s success; which tu ... (122 characters truncated) ... ile Kim can’t cook a single thing, Ron is chosen to help Kim out.  Can Kim overcome her predicament or is this one sitch that she cannot escape from?', '2003-08-01', 22, 7.0, 5, '/aTmlwNvPZXciFibrhpj4X1bsyEg.jpg', None, 'ed9785450805483a98fc0f01b63e7fb6', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171242, 4, 'The Ron Factor', 'When Dr. Director at Global Justice decides that it\\'s the \"Ron-ness\" that\\'s Kim\\'s secret to success, Ron goes under the microscope. Unfortunately, ... (59 characters truncated) ... r. Director\\'s older twin. Global Justice, Kim, and Rufus take on Gemini\\'s fist of fury (and Pepe the neurotic Chihuahua) to recover the Ron Factor.', '2003-08-08', 22, 6.6, 5, '/fQ0o8f9HkhMgMpYoaBGe1lW4Vsk.jpg', None, '0682703231b543abba7e196096d32dc0', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866' ... 260 parameters truncated ... '/bwwL5I0dDgF46EBpUkwHjUnQyYl.jpg', None, 'c0173a8510b045f7a08b198eedeb93ef', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171238, 27, 'Motor Ed', 'After a series of high tech robberies, Kim tries to stop the plot of a rogue scientist turned rocking trucker, with a little help from a new friend, Felix.', '2004-05-21', 22, 6.6, 5, '/ve25prMP5THuySV3Av1CtY895Da.jpg', None, '918122556c4144b4b459b957c2532b10', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171239, 28, 'Ron Millionaire', \"Naco royalties make Ron a tremendously rich and wealthy multimillionaire with ninety-nine million dollars, which he then proceeds to squander on a po ... (15 characters truncated) ... ends and spending binges. Out of greed, Dr. Drakken attempts to steal Ron's newly acquired fortune and wealth to complete his latest doomsday scheme.\", '2004-06-04', 22, 6.8, 5, '/ibyuyv1mRSaTUN3UjFZNluTUlos.jpg', None, '7694ab21026a4082a1d57d7dbe5d3137', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171240, 29, 'Triple S', 'After a long list of attempts to turn himself into a jock go sour, Ron gets a new chance to compete in the X games when he and Kim are sent to investigate a series of robberies.', '2004-07-26', 22, 6.8, 5, '/mIhjDehFqt0xydpAm55YOC2k4Sa.jpg', None, 'f8f8c0d7b3424010ab10758333a556bc', '578bf154d25541f18b6e9466b4cc6866', 171241, 30, 'Rewriting History', 'While Kim and Ron are at the Museum, she discovers that one of her ancestors was a thief and she decides to figure out what really happened in order  ... (212 characters truncated) ... t what exactly happened to cause her ancestor to get framed, though Ron keeps feeling that something about their predicament just doesn’t feel right.', '2004-08-05', 22, 7.0, 5, '/c6zOzoNRRKrHda4iVa9LrA2rRRA.jpg', None)"}
