{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:18.093293+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 74.46s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('687e499adf7944aab17e214f7d0faa5c', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171247, 1, 'Steal Wheels', 'When Dr. Drakken is ordered by his mother to look after his cousin which turns out to be Motor Ed, Drakken and Motor Ed work together to complete a “ ... (352 characters truncated) ...  Drakken and Motor Ed steal Felix’s wheelchair, they work together to see if they can retrieve his wheelchair back and put an end to their evil plan.', '2004-09-25', 22, 6.6, 5, '/wx6IzNaQJsE3eN6bWH24kQiuGQV.jpg', None, '700d179baf9e4b25b6f3d3d4c9213d4f', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171248, 2, 'Emotion Sickness', 'While trying to stop Dr. Drakken, Kim gets into a fight with Shego in which they accidentally get a microchip attached to each of them that can contr ... (293 characters truncated) ... es towards him while trying to determine what he should do about the situation, all the while Drakken is dealing with a suddenly love-stricken Shego.', '2004-10-15', 22, 7.0, 5, '/yDKwcN8xi5KQxqf1mQSaXyFtCXX.jpg', None, 'dbe4f577b73449eaa48d59006af20353', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171249, 3, 'Bonding', 'When Kim and Ron go to stop Professor Dementor from stealing from a top-secret research laboratory, Ron inadvertently catches Dementor’s “Bondo-Ball” ... (281 characters truncated) ... them and there’s still Professor Dementor to worry about; but will Kim and Ron gain any insight towards the life of their enemies through the ordeal?', '2004-10-22', 22, 7.0, 5, '/wheumJfrvisXeYOPwA59bUek8xE.jpg', None, '8e778240ca6d4539b8e42521c8a4a6cd', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171250, 4, 'Bad Boy', 'When Ron is trying to prove he’s old enough to not be forced to sit at the children’s table at a wedding when he realizes that his evil cousin Sean w ... (513 characters truncated) ... sing Ron to become a maniacal madman and Dr. Drakken to become a kind spirited individual, Kim realizes that a bad Ron may be more than she expected.', '2005-01-14', 22, 6.8, 5, '/sufO2HuXt3lbZQXBTOy2sUSK94J.jpg', None, 'b3c0dc0d908241c181bee0f1ddeed155', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c' ... 44 parameters truncated ... '/knIpqDVkrxRJckX26eYhv5UH7jL.jpg', None, '8c7440250e21458589b0b4d087cb37a7', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171255, 9, \"Rappin' Drakken\", 'After Kim constantly foils Dr. Drakken’s evil plans, he decides to try to take over the world through his brain washing shampoo “Lather, Rinse, Obey” ... (253 characters truncated) ... ontest in order to become a star long enough to make his shampoo sell.  However, with Kim on his trail, will she be able to foil his plan once again?', '2005-06-25', 22, 7.0, 5, '/cfmlEn0ICZwzXKPgszog6oXGX46.jpg', None, '259d08cab0d347d38abdc810fa2934c7', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171258, 10, 'Team Impossible', 'When Team Impossible demands that Kim cease her duties as a teen hero, Kim is caught between a choice to live a normal life or continue to help save  ... (65 characters truncated) ...  on a regular basis, can she outmatch three of the highest paid heroes in the world who have everything at their disposal, even their own theme song?', '2005-08-26', 22, 7.0, 5, '/1sEHyaMbuvtniTtExQvUYJrmHH7.jpg', None, '1d5db3e1828044428ac77356eb0cd6d3', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171257, 11, 'Gorilla Fist', 'Yori’s sensei has been kidnapped and all evidence indicates that Lord Monkey Fist is responsible for it.  Yori comes to Middleton to get Ron, in whic ... (89 characters truncated) ... hen Kim starts to grow suspicious about Yori’s sudden appearance in Middleton, she heads after them to get to get to the bottom of their predicament.', '2005-11-18', 22, 6.8, 5, '/4q42lMdO7kUvODYhDJOUbVBJm9U.jpg', None, '75934cc682e94ec9b30f00fc7263ca66', 'b3a3ee8658f14d578c7c5b6167fb2a4c', 171256, 12, 'And the Molerat Will Be CGI', \"Junior attempts to rob the Tower of London, but accidentally tries to rob a movie set replica. Kim and Ron go to stop them and perform an extreme mid ... (264 characters truncated) ... e act completely opposite of him. All of this while they have to stop Junior who is out for revenge on the director for not putting him in the movie.\", '2006-06-10', 22, 7.0, 5, '/hywm9CzD4Ue3ZHVCcaIefKxZVHp.jpg', None)"}
