{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:18.290855+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 74.65s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('3dd8dc9617854868bfc284fdfd583f50', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171281, 1, 'Ill-Suited', \"Ron steals Kim's supersuit to use in the upcoming football game. Meanwhile, Professor Dementor becomes jealous of the suit and devises a system to control it.\", '2007-02-10', 22, 5.3, 7, '/d6uDaDaS8tI5LSC5vG1lztptv2R.jpg', None, '794866a3f52748ac87f196ebcfbae5a5', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171282, 2, 'The Big Job', \"When Señor Senior Junior breaks Shego out of prison to help him get his father a great birthday present, it's up to Kim and Ron to stop them. Meanwhile, Kim urges Ron to get a job after he uses coupons on their date.\", '2007-02-10', 22, 5.4, 7, '/x6wXQCUl1A3v7cKvhhgSKKR6GD8.jpg', None, 'c33a9a701a4a4b7c8d2e528d5bd59813', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171283, 3, 'Trading Faces', 'Kim investigates a string of celebrity robberies, but comes up empty-handed. Meanwhile, the tweebs enter Middleton High School as freshmen. Ashley Tisdale guest stars.', '2007-02-10', 22, 7.0, 5, '/x1lmm0ZAWzGMyrXTyYQF8pJ5GF1.jpg', None, 'dbb76b8150b14a7face1630ce1d5357a', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171284, 4, 'The Cupid Effect', 'Ron offers Wade advice on how to woo Monique, but when it backfires, the young supergenius creates a Cupid Ray. Unfortunately, the device falls into the hands of Senor Senior Senior, who uses it to help Junior seduce all the women in the world.', '2007-02-10', 22, 6.6, 5, '/jmoEZK4JaV0ZYPrsrnhQtWAS8d8.jpg', None, '08063c9d6f5045969ea17ce195a1e811', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6' ... 176 parameters truncated ... '/4HKU31Lmr0oYsZNIPwaTEGJh16x.jpg', None, '062bec8cc3434c9e97422e2a1149dbfc', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171296, 20, 'Nursery Crimes', 'When the mysterious and creepy Nanny Maim begins reverting people into super babies and using them in a world-wide robbing spree, Kim must use her natural baby-sitting skills to save the day.', '2007-08-12', 11, 6.8, 5, '/jzQSA9o5TFxymNbCMIRDNizvTdm.jpg', None, '00d2c131a16a4bf1ac0b3b1ddfc77a5c', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171299, 21, \"Larry's Birthday\", \"Kim plans on throwing her cousin Larry a surprise birthday party, but she has to keep him busy until the party is ready. Meanwhile, Dementor enlists the help of his brother-in-law to steal Kim's battlesuit.\", '2007-09-01', 22, 7.0, 5, '/oJMvFiO80EuDUQCjjHj3Pi0Hnxc.jpg', None, '64babe3d13e542f9bb0c14c49130eb87', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171300, 22, 'Graduation, Part 1', \"High school graduation nears for the senior class, but Warmonga's return jeopardizes everything as Team Possible goes through their toughest odds yet to save the planet.\", '2007-09-07', 22, 7.0, 5, '/kvhVNGBFiPkc482Vd83vqT2OhpS.jpg', None, '4e86b71183614268b860469c082bd157', 'cdb69587541643469cba276f93a12fb6', 171301, 23, 'Graduation, Part 2', 'After both Kim and Drakken have been taken captive, Ron and Shego must race to rescue them from the clutches of Warmonga, Warhok, and the other invaders. All of the main characters must now band together to save the planet that they call home.', '2007-09-07', 22, 7.0, 5, '/qgeCZdKnWjghwPEoseopHOGPkKG.jpg', None)"}
