{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:19.372725+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 75.74s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('f49a10543e034cb3a55ec9297d3d4039', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82658, 1, 'Birthday Presence', 'Melinda gives birth to a baby boy who has inherited her gift of seeing spirits. However, the baby has one important difference in gift which will have extreme consequences.', '2009-09-25', 45, 7.0, 2, '/gixCTMe7M2P0qgdk2x0TfCKJLQ.jpg', None, 'e1d33f7616dc45b98d1e5e2b86738f4f', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82622, 2, 'See No Evil', 'Melinda looks into a chain email that appears to be preying on the citizens of Grandview.', '2009-10-02', 42, 8.0, 1, '/6CSqxxQyztGizBUNhicIr4XLAMs.jpg', None, 'fd6478556f0849478a02fa38fd9749b4', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82624, 3, 'Till Death Do Us Start', \"A messy family reunion ensues after Eli's father suffers from a heart attack. Eli also has a reunion with his mother who has been unable to cross over for ten years\", '2009-10-09', 44, 8.0, 1, '/pp90F0PvZIOo61m0rjy7W3RDWUS.jpg', None, '981201a0d9f74b33a553ce4b2e3fd8ca', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82626, 4, 'Do Over', 'Melinda helps a dead doctor who is reliving a surgery that went wrong.', '2009-10-16', 45, 8.0, 1, '/83l3aLIEBU08kDdjhUtLvgAq8p4.jpg', None, '88925c00fbff46e9aa0f51c13487890e', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/sfT0SitjMLSoHTc7f9UigFMUSUb.jpg', None, '748bd8726beb42ffaf6e8f1bee1bac2a', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82649, 19, 'Lethal Combination', \"When Aiden is put in danger, Melinda won't accept anything but the truth and sets out on a shocking investigation into the life of an angry murdered ghost. Meanwhile, Jim is caught snooping through files in the file room at his work by the morgue coroner Dr. Mavis.\", '2010-04-30', 45, 8.0, 1, '/shDFWMBUM6AwAihdZi3pUaX4sP4.jpg', None, '35fd4a270f624f079a8a9a16b658b0c9', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82677, 20, 'Blood Money', \"Henry was 18 years old when he was killed, with a gunshot wound in his chest. In life he was a decent boy from a wealthy, loving family, whose parent ... (99 characters truncated) ... wn kidnapping with a friend of his, and seems relieved to be able to explain to his mother, via Melinda, that he's felt guilt and remorse ever since.\", '2010-05-07', 45, 8.0, 2, '/3GNHpZViDVsqMLQYjoa6jzh0MQi.jpg', None, 'e79577f9ddbc4b9ea3d867e0e9a5f2b1', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82675, 21, 'Dead Ringer', 'When the ghost Melinda is trying to help suddenly turns up alive, she finds herself in the middle of a dangerous revenge plot and battling enemies she was unaware she had.', '2010-05-14', 45, 8.0, 1, '/g3n6HfVIV81e3OWwreS8fdgC876.jpg', None, 'ff86f8a25afb4acbbd092a9ecaa1434b', 'd1856a8b1ed44b6cbf06e2acea774919', 82661, 22, \"The Children's Parade\", \"Jim's hospital is being haunted by the ghosts of kids from an abandoned polio ward in the early 1900’s. And the connection of Aidan, Melinda, the Shinies and the Shadows will come to a climax and Melinda and Jim will realize that they know almost nothing about Aiden's powers.\", '2010-05-21', 45, 3.5, 4, '/f6esMQmnETLjsBN6L7bN4B6mu6e.jpg', None)"}
