tle their differences on the dance floor and each show off their best moves. Meanwhile, Bree gets to know her crush, but he gets to know her glitche', '2012-03-12', 23, 5.3, 3, '/yP4Wtq0LMZBk6P2ozsKaSeuNQWA.jpg', None, 'faf72b49c0f846629c7149571b56937d', '71a9258fce8741049612560bc3082f83' ... 140 parameters truncated ... '/5HxVjCU5GjX2ZbymA5P3ZM0Ltwj.jpg', None, 'f5afd2978b5241debc19eb9f810184e5', '71a9258fce8741049612560bc3082f83', 863566, 17, 'Night of the Living Virus', 'When Leo accidentally messes up Eddy, an evil demon Teddy replaces him.', '2012-10-15', 22, 3.0, 1, '/7AZhiiORKRDOMf0NdJ2SrhTj6MH.jpg', None, '4ce713b3bf954ba9a66063cdc4abe17e', '71a9258fce8741049612560bc3082f83', 863567, 18, 'Mission Invisible', \"Adam, Bree, and Chase are caught on Principal Perry's surveillance camera using bionics.\", '2012-10-22', 22, 3.0, 1, '/u2O9hnmPfrLlmenO7CAXwvvgNzG.jpg', None, '072b96eda513472b9f98206ade26e9cd', '71a9258fce8741049612560bc3082f83', 863568, 19, 'Concert in a Can', \"Leo is blamed for breaking Marcus' guitar.\", '2012-10-29', 22, 3.0, 1, '/yYKllSuAlmXmRX7pjQaBaE9RKjM.jpg', None, 'ad4a7ef3a9fa4f09bd50b0eb81e94255', '71a9258fce8741049612560bc3082f83', 863569, 20, 'Mission: Space', 'Chase accidentally discovers that he has a hidden ability - telekinesis.', '2012-11-05', 22, 3.0, 1, '/aLEUjNJgIAf6akuF4XgKgVnlNzK.jpg', None)"}
