{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:19.926874+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 76.29s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('1113fe77dcbd42808053a7b3acbdc7a2', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 863570, 1, 'Speed Trapped', 'Adam, Bree, and Chase sneak out to meet Marcus in Davenport’s new self-driving sports car. When Leo tries to stop them, his nemesis Marcus traps him inside the car and programs it to take him on a wild, high-speed ride bound for the bottom of the Pacific Ocean.', '2013-02-25', 23, 3.0, 1, '/wUD2zdWCwAgse4CfvOgtFreZqRk.jpg', None, 'b8da00cb90e8462dbf84d6de752a83e4', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 863578, 2, 'Spy Fly', 'Leo turns to Bree for help after he mistakenly unleashes a swarm of robotic flies on the school. Adam and Chase turn their class assignment into a destructive competition.', '2013-03-04', 22, 3.0, 1, '/7CY3A4XMz0fVNCBz5mNUHgyw6X0.jpg', None, '654ba9602b6f436c8e04e05790ae72e2', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 863574, 3, \"Missin' the Mission\", 'Leo finally goes a mission as he helps Davenport and Eddy attempt to stop an underground gas leak. Adam, Bree and Chase struggle to escape from Principal Perry’s detention lockdown.', '2013-03-11', 22, 3.0, 1, '/s7WFVgIh9mxVcS9lQOEb7claUl3.jpg', None, 'e638883fdd594ca8bcfe3cfc35b80977', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 863579, 4, 'Quarantined', \"Bree is exposed to a toxic chemical sending Adam and Chase on a mission for an antidote. Bree escapes quarantine and when her side effects kick in, it's up to Leo to get her back to her capsule.\", '2013-03-18', 22, 3.0, 1, '/wdHhWGwEHwgR247ltVcUz67G0gD.jpg', None, 'e7d724574dde4fcf8a900b180a7e53ce', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1' ... 212 parameters truncated ... '/3xsfnC07ZdEGHo4LwNOPRRlo7sA.jpg', None, '0f86bd4dbf284e228a76e759160490b7', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 979806, 23, 'Prank You Very Much', \"Bree is tired of being the target of the boys' pranks.\", '2013-11-25', None, 3.0, 1, '/plgneqDG06GJwN5adMZ3cNh6bI5.jpg', None, '1235f34264dd4083bc5a2abdc0afc501', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 979807, 24, 'Twas the Mission Before Christmas', \"The Lab Rats go on a rescue mission to save Dr. Evans and travel to Davenport's secret facility in the frozen tundra.\", '2013-12-02', None, 3.0, 1, '/46zV8PryunNoYRBR86pjDqHJFJQ.jpg', None, '5b612d7dba1542a997adcf373fca3e91', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 979808, 25, 'Trent Gets Schooled', \"Leo and Chase use Davenport's technology to get back at Trent on the day of a big test; Bree gets exposed to a hair growth cream with bad results.\", '2014-01-06', None, 3.0, 1, '/gfurVkhM2tjh722hFJdhGQy0uZM.jpg', None, '356e9440b04e448aaa584c37f8fc5ef5', 'bf19399480b84a68917218f445684be1', 979809, 26, 'No Going Back', 'The Lab Rats are forced to expose their bionic secret in order to save Principal Perry.', '2014-01-13', None, 3.0, 1, '/iMCs6B3KCbLJZDH24TnF1cOuT2l.jpg', None)"}
