{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:20.821986+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 77.19s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('c653a1abaef947f9b58e3358f08bd57d', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333468, 1, 'Odd Couples', \"Maddie helps London become smart to win over the affection of a scholar. Meanwhile, Cody moves into the coat closet and makes it is own room after he has enough of Zack's sloppiness.\", '2006-02-03', 23, 10.0, 1, '/lG37TdqMcPuE6Jr9gE4rzSKjoy.jpg', None, '8c41684f67e141b6bfe9a8af47314a0f', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333456, 2, 'French 101', \"Zack and Cody fall for a French girl who can't speak English very well. Meanwhile, somebody steals London's purse and Esteban tries to help.\", '2006-02-10', 23, 10.0, 1, '/y0NvxJZtrqI7qgMR32cuwYi6tJY.jpg', None, '33e5f31c990244e9bd580aaaaeb9827f', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333469, 3, 'Day Care', 'Maddie runs a Daycare Service at the Tipton, and when Maddie has a family obligation to attend to, Zack and Cody take over.  Meanwhile, London encourages Mr. Moseby to take yoga to help him relax a bit more.', '2006-02-17', 23, 10.0, 1, '/amaKFBKMjdmLCwNuxEAGIZcl8sk.jpg', None, 'b84ae72865ae4610999c5a6da97f9495', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333470, 4, \"Heck's Kitchen\", \"A food critic is coming to the Tipton Hotel. Cody ends up having to fulfill the duties of being head chef, after the Tipton's regular chef suddenly quits, on a very important day.\", '2006-02-24', 23, 10.0, 1, '/v1VzWJN6PoXPb2fvJjqqhIvbqB.jpg', None, '1e04f5834e0f47b0ba9de7d0be745735', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16' ... 368 parameters truncated ... '/87Fp6MbvJ4og7SE2VhmBO3O1gge.jpg', None, 'cce017f16ab54719bea5d18eef5ab4e5', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333492, 36, 'The Suite Life Goes Hollywood (1)', 'After two struggling television writers take inspiration from the Tipton, the gang is flown out to L.A. to serve as consultants on the new show. After the \"Zack\" & \"Cody\" actors don\\'t pan out, the twins end up cast as themselves.', '2007-04-20', 23, 10.0, 1, '/adcPBRRt7AQepzYlJ51BJtq4buF.jpg', None, 'b2bf4ef64a194bdfb094ff06a180e5c4', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333459, 37, 'The Suite Life Goes Hollywood (2)', 'Zack & Cody are cast in a TV show based on the Tipton - \"How Suite It Is\". Maddie and London sneak onto a Old West movie set in an attempt to meet heartthrob Johnny Vaine.', '2007-04-20', 23, 10.0, 1, '/dRpf3jovaB2tBOJ6l60staW1wTf.jpg', None, '85f9b9cc09094fa19920af1a8246a83e', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333491, 38, 'I Want My Mummy', \"When Zack and Cody knock an ancient mummy over the balcony, Zack dresses Cody up to replace it for the exhibit. Esteban is scared of the curse of the mummy, so he and Maddie try to swap the mummy for Maddie's old doll.\", '2007-05-18', 23, 10.0, 1, '/o1EwZTcS3k8GZgUtGGAF4jgCIPx.jpg', None, '1100e7a316ce4b0fb6d6c46cd4f840b2', '81fed04c555b4890a0ddfcdf24d03a16', 333458, 39, 'Aptitude', \"Zack and Cody are not happy about their career aptitude tests. London gets jealous of Maddie when she saves the Moroccan ambassador's life and gets on television.\", '2007-06-02', 23, 10.0, 1, '/6IfAvzwHMBW5oSdHOaBLXExiANA.jpg', None)"}
