{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:20.985563+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 77.35s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('98b26abf2a3940e3a5cf00b97b510c0e', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333519, 1, 'Graduation', 'Cody is graduating from 8th grade as class valedictorian. But Zack is horrified to learn that he has to attend summer school and tries to hide it from his parents. Meanwhile, Maddie becomes a camp counselor at a run down facility with less than ideal girls under her wing.', '2007-06-23', 23, 10.0, 1, '/p7sIlYGzmD2kk4exDDr0jOirNvy.jpg', None, 'd216a79faef545c39e9337f7da740901', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333520, 2, 'Summer of Our Discontent', 'Cody searches for a summer job, and finds a \"help wanted\" sign at the local mini-mart. When the owner realizes Cody is friends with London, he will o ... (12 characters truncated) ... y if he will set him up on a date with her. Zack discovers he is the smartest student in his summer-school class, all the other kids make fun of him.', '2007-06-30', 23, 8.0, 2, '/8c0Q9JSs4dvH1dJyHZBLepTr7Vc.jpg', None, 'e303847f4a8e4f95ad4c72829e2cba5f', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333521, 3, 'Sink or Swim', \"The tabloids report London doesn't know how to swim, so she takes swimming lessons. Zack has been offered to work at the hotel as a plumber or to work at a local market.\", '2007-07-08', 23, 10.0, 1, '/i9aWkkyP7zdGR15fsl13zzQZbcU.jpg', None, 'bd14ffa5917d4242995cd75f72c940cf', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333522, 4, 'Super Twins', 'Zack and Cody wish for superhero powers when they see a shooting star. Their wish comes true and they learn that Mr. Moseby is their villain, who wants to turn all kids into miniature adults.', '2007-07-13', 23, 10.0, 1, '/3uWCfMECPf8V43iQcq03OAZFcIi.jpg', None, 'af022e67ad60406882daceef05d2e2f0', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/ualpH3TjbKtCMaMLm0U2R0QFpgy.jpg', None, '240c8aa946bf49d2af1fa4f38a4f8f55', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333518, 19, 'Benchwarmers', \"Zack tries out for the high school basketball team but realizes there's some stiff competition, the kind he didn't face in middle school, and worse y ... (45 characters truncated) ... hael Clarke Duncan). Meanwhile, when they're rejected as cheerleaders, Cody and London form their own cheerleading squad with the help of Mr. Moseby.\", '2008-07-19', 23, 0.0, 0, '/zL5C4nuhMEuOTd0bFdaPC79pTZc.jpg', None, 'f183c511c2444730b2720413230df7b2', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333537, 20, \"Doin' Time in Suite 2330\", \"Maddie, Cody and Zack compete to get the best guest for London's online chat show. Luckily, The Cheetah Girls and Chris Brown are staying at the Tipton, but who will end up winning the competition?\", '2008-08-09', 23, 0.0, 0, '/kly9Mbu7olyj7zLEzgMiq8X12z8.jpg', None, '4c306873b40c4537ab3a82ba5146893a', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333538, 21, 'Let Us Entertain You', 'Zack and Cody offer to bring their mother on a week-long vacation to the S.S. Tipton, staying in the King Neptune Suite, which overjoys Carey. Howeve ... (1178 characters truncated) ... ll their performances had been for nothing. Instead, they decide to give the left-over food from the Tipton to the food shelter once or twice a week.', '2008-08-16', 23, 0.0, 0, '/zrXaYaO07pXT7XO3MjhAYzxMcvu.jpg', None, '39b307ee872a46c99523f9a05b5ea2e1', '1c341b08df9b4fb0b9ecaaa08fc507ff', 333539, 22, 'Mr Tipton Comes to Visit', \"The news of a visit from Mr. Tipton gets the employees excited (and reminiscing) about their good deeds as to who deserves a possible bonus… but when ... (10 characters truncated) ...  out Mr. Tipton is in a bad mood and will fire someone, all fingers point to Carey because of the boys' mishaps, but Zack & Cody come up with a plan.\", '2008-09-01', 23, 5.0, 1, '/pkpmgNpiwvoNrY2je6HyYMGGlmO.jpg', None)"}
