s disarmament camp and chance survival in a daring escape through the jungle.', '2009-08-05', 45, 0.0, 0, '/6UN8qYYaey2OUY7lPBwNF6KlE19.jpg', None, '0740a842fccd4ca2a93e6694fbacad06', '57d777456c3c4180a8437ceda2468952', 3047051, 12, 'Jamaica/Jamaican Getaway', \"T.K. White and her girlfriend are sent to Kingston's notorious central prison after attempting to smuggle marijuana.\", '2009-08-11', 45, 0.0, 0, '/8HrMs3JlCgio5fRsuPN37GqiFWS.jpg', None, '4a590d6a2ca94ac7b1a1caccaa1d4d0c', '57d777456c3c4180a8437ceda2468952', 3047052, 13, 'India/Delhi/Party Girl', \"Clare Matthews quits her job and travels to India. But when money gets tight, she gambles for a quick payout: sending hash illegally to London via parcel. It works the first time, even the second. But the third time, her luck runs out and she ends up in one of the world's largest jails.\", '2009-08-19', 45, 0.0, 0, '/yfkoOdL8RvMqbPFk963J6tcYviZ.jpg', None)"}
