{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:22.731210+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 79.09s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('af8da25853f04882aa4c88d1fcc47156', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260618, 1, 'The Real Goodfella', 'Henry Hill--who inspired the movie Goodfellas--relays the true story of his rise and fall as a drug dealing wiseguy in the New York mob.', '2011-10-04', 45, 0.0, 0, '/svSNFpIpoD4x98tmCp4NgrtOeVv.jpg', None, 'f6eb91b6550140b68df52ce8f573c8ec', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260688, 2, 'Saudi Bootlegger', 'Scottish chef Gordon Malloch arrives in Saudi Arabia to start a new life as a catering manager, but quickly finds himself a profitable sideline as a bootlegger.', '2011-10-11', 45, 0.0, 0, '/9g9ufYnywRVqvgsZ3g9IeUrdspw.jpg', None, 'db840396311347bb85f734c8ada24047', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260689, 3, 'Forbidden Love', 'Briton David Scott tells the story of finding his soulmate in the Philippines, and risking a 14-year prison sentence for adultery.', '2011-10-18', 45, 0.0, 0, '/7Q1mDGEJX1NMEkjlvvTmtmUx0Rr.jpg', None, 'bf77d60c097147c88271dbd46647bf7c', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260691, 4, 'Mexico Money Machine', 'After heading to Mexico with a suitcase of fake money to buy drugs, California bodybuilder Jeremy Khinoo finds himself behind bars and in big trouble.', '2011-10-25', 45, 0.0, 0, '/vZGWx5NlwWGGRIYsMCXTDrhqobP.jpg', None, '29a22460c58d4e51b249b1dfb73801c3', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/7lsDZqMXyvI41EKHvQfK13G9xyu.jpg', None, 'b3db68ee3ab843b4bbfb46d082eb97c0', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260726, 7, 'The Cocaine Trap', 'Stephen Sutton gets caught up when he is offered $15,000 to transport cocaine disguised as gold, leading to an 11-year prison sentence.', '2011-11-15', 45, 0.0, 0, '/zzxJaD45pbr1h0doVTjI753hgw0.jpg', None, '490d68cd5b6844d9938b7592ac0a059c', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260727, 8, 'Drug Dealer Revenge', 'Company director Robert Pringle is sentenced to seven years in a violent South-American lock-up after being pressured by his dealer to smuggle drugs.', '2011-11-22', 45, 0.0, 0, '/zzwwMhBs85yov5134zxKEVjACe3.jpg', None, 'ed8e0bd1c983450193124d0534d9e7f7', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260729, 9, 'Teenage Drug Smuggler', 'Vivian Carrasquillo faces a crash diet in jail after an attempt to raise funds for gastric bypass surgery by becoming a drug mule backfires.', '2011-11-29', 45, 0.0, 0, '/uK3HZvQS9K7anGMeKS5WCl2Tgul.jpg', None, 'a762ea957f5f4e1c976952ecf01dfa15', 'e4d179bcb48d467fbde4d466fe396c29', 3260730, 10, 'Backstabbed in Thailand', 'Military veteran Kim Hood faces life behind bars in a squalid Thai prison after being caught smuggling 14 kilos of heroin with a friend, Lisa Taylor.', '2011-12-06', 45, 0.0, 0, '/oZ2G84yEW1FEx2rtHxwOlMH4lSC.jpg', None)"}
