{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:22.878816+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 79.24s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('48d8dd9012064449b27becb04391b32a', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260734, 1, 'From Hollywood to Hell', 'When young actor Erik Audé discovers that he was tricked into smuggling opium out of Pakistan, he must fight to stay alive and clear his name.', '2012-04-25', 45, 0.0, 0, '/6TU8OLZFpQxr6LfmLhV70ZwBu7Q.jpg', None, 'cc23509242e1400db8fe7915e57088ce', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260735, 2, 'The Juggler Smuggler', 'Travelling magician Mark Greening juggles a young family with a budding hash-smuggling business after moving to Japan, but he soon gets caught.', '2012-05-02', 45, 0.0, 0, '/jRZxn1DTRmTp9ELTsYNr4hMg977.jpg', None, '12035ea5ae8d4b96825fe852cefba88d', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260736, 3, 'Escape from Argentina', 'Lucy Wright is a nursing student when her life goes from bad to worse to hell. Her boyfriend leaves, she becomes addicted to crack, and the bills keep piling up.', '2012-05-09', 45, 0.0, 0, '/7QeTIQ5l7WyGMsj77fkygIi8qdc.jpg', None, '9b21219f40124bc8b85d7282da61e4d7', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260737, 4, 'Highway to Hell', 'Adventure-seeker Thomas Hamill takes a job driving trucks in Iraq, leading to a terrifying time in captivity after being kidnapped by insurgents.', '2012-05-16', 45, 0.0, 0, '/vNqkApnmdE4RYu3MROeThFg6UCi.jpg', None, '646860bf005541bca7a0286d3d4626c8', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/2ojoJRwE4Z05UNx0iWsVLFCIhgg.jpg', None, '8fe008fd252d4bdb854f72342311b5a7', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260740, 7, 'Dangerous Liaisons', 'British nurse Stephen Comiskey, who takes a job in Saudi Arabia to support his family, draws the unwelcome attention of the Saudi religious police after a series of illicit gay affairs.', '2012-06-06', 45, 0.0, 0, '/ppTOZnd2pj0gCxOZMc7VYWzXAUY.jpg', None, '44fb476af515458cac4626106a080ecf', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260741, 8, 'Colombian Kidnap', 'Erez Eltawil and Reini Weigel are among eight backpackers who are snatched by guerrillas during a trek in remote northern Colombia.', '2012-06-13', 45, 0.0, 0, '/vRicqcZRgfngHa30U8KSQL8Dwjh.jpg', None, 'b717c8040b314e00ac8fdb4796419331', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260742, 9, 'Caribbean Nightmare', \"David and Jayne Bladen's dream of a new life overseas turns into a nightmare journey of drug smuggling and violence culminating in 20 months behind bars.\", '2012-06-20', 45, 0.0, 0, '/obWMfZIuVVbxe24gnOjD1yPrPcB.jpg', None, '1708c5168e84404b883c4e3e71376f6e', 'bd80388a6d004bcea0138837fb6ae9aa', 3260744, 10, 'Son of Saddam', \"Iraqi soldier Latif Yahia describes how he was summoned to Saddam Hussein's palace and forced to become the body double of the dictator's eldest and most notorious son, Uday.\", '2012-06-27', 45, 0.0, 0, '/7lHATtHLmRgdVF8JldwqciMcS9f.jpg', None)"}
