{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:23.039916+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 79.4s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('40026545ecff465d819d3be83d3e39c6', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260745, 1, 'My Dad the Smuggler', 'Scott Campbell goes travelling in China with his estranged father, only to find out that his dad is a professional smuggler carrying 20 kilos of cannabis.', '2012-07-02', 45, 0.0, 0, '/sQT3QaP9IxURKQ6kCofSDl3jcp6.jpg', None, '41bcea75081340778b023261710b5dfd', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260750, 2, 'I Am Not a Terrorist', 'Duane Wollum is about to make some easy money smuggling cocaine, until an airport security check reveals that he is concealing a package.', '2012-07-09', 45, 0.0, 0, '/atL3AvfeU9LvIWhr9UacvmmX8OL.jpg', None, '944c568605404ee9ba054bf9833c368d', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260751, 3, 'Hasidic King of Coke', 'Orthodox Jew Samuel Leibowitz dreams of making millions as a drug kingpin in Brazil, leading to a terrifying term in the deadly Carandiru Penitentiary.', '2012-07-16', 45, 0.0, 0, '/4TnFhno3eAe9sLAuvRIIPqvxJK6.jpg', None, '9a290b90b9f54238bdc916ffda231be2', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260752, 4, 'Not Without My Baby', \"When Susan's Haglof's adoption goes wrong, she ends up in an Egyptian jail, facing a charge of human trafficking.\", '2012-07-23', 45, 0.0, 0, '/2cUwMTffWE2Td5HX9KZj47AfxnP.jpg', None, 'bec72ea19a6f4ad6ab4e59d1cc06e5f1', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/n9JR2Fwu0vk9Q8Bi6myMv6PDIOd.jpg', None, 'fbfeadba0f794d08861bb4ac0bfabc43', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260755, 7, 'Venezuela Hustle', 'Desperate to keep his family afloat, Paul Keany agrees to smuggle six kilos of cocaine from Venezuela back to Dublin, but it turns out to be the worst decision of his life.', '2012-08-13', 45, 0.0, 0, '/uwuCvlYYugLjw0Fs7YEnICZNDiG.jpg', None, 'f15a3b9ef7574d26939d1e27ef0ec98c', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260756, 8, 'Busted in Bangkok', 'Thrown into a notorious Bangkok prison for attempting to smuggle heroin, Angela Carnegie has an epiphany while nursing a fellow inmate with a drug addiction.', '2012-08-27', 45, 0.0, 0, '/ormhW8Gw5ELlnFR7XRThIP1OanI.jpg', None, '20ae52a8109b4536b3dc00d5cb63dc08', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260757, 9, 'Nightmare in Somalia', 'The terrifying story of photojournalist Nigel Brennan and reporter Amanda Lindhout, who are held hostage for 15 months by a criminal gang in Somalia.', '2012-11-28', 45, 0.0, 0, '/wir0iZomg1QtSC8utj7y5exHXK6.jpg', None, '0bb30ea3bde545549d8163b72f996607', '3574c77d609b4215b8b835e1d9d87ca2', 3260759, 10, 'Escape From the Gulag', \"It's 1976 in Cold War Moscow, and American Jerry Amster finds himself in the worst situation possible: busted for smuggling drugs from Kuala Lumpur to Russia.\", '2012-12-12', 45, 0.0, 0, '/o4tgA3rXbooCTqUaaS6dVwWC11j.jpg', None)"}
