{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:23.188896+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 79.55s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('eb2a5db260ae468eb05658f3e8ddd182', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260760, 1, 'Vietnam POWs: McCain and Brace', \"As the longest POW in Vietnam, Ernie Brace likely endured more than any other POW during the war. After years in the jungle, he went to the infamous 'Hanoi Hilton' prison and heard an American voice: Lt. Cmdr. John McCain.\", '2013-04-17', 45, 0.0, 0, '/paNkXzVLyl9neq33Ujy1CN8LY2w.jpg', None, 'd8b3e4cb5d70494496359ac353d9fd96', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260761, 2, 'Raving Arizona', 'Shaun Attwood left England to be a stockbroker in America and finds himself dealing ecstasy.', '2013-04-24', 45, 0.0, 0, '/mZOgp3qEwSoWwIgKLEaSkSPwco2.jpg', None, '7d713c31e7b5406cbd9e239f1f517415', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260762, 3, 'Snakes on a Plane', 'Tom Crutchfield smuggled snakes, tarantulas and king cobras around the world. But when the U.S. builds a case against him, Tom escapes to Belize. There, authorities imprison him without electricity or plumbing.', '2013-05-01', 45, 0.0, 0, '/sDOYA44gCrEdgsMskXl9tEotWBh.jpg', None, 'd151a1cbf8bc408192d447a6a9451e4e', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260763, 4, 'Buried Alive', 'For Roy Hallums, a routine trip to the office turned into the fight for his life. In 2004, the 20-year Navy veteran was working in Iraq when he was suddenly kidnapped.', '2013-05-08', 45, 0.0, 0, '/1xY0XWKnLCZkEaboErSL0tsveQN.jpg', None, 'a3d63558d1644ae2ae6b3a67d52fbb83', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/7ZQAE7qdHAHoH2sSYrhH6L9vNgX.jpg', None, 'a6e1ed5ef2114937ab2254dae03f077c', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260767, 7, 'Hippie Mafia', \"Eddie Padilla is living the 'high life' and drug smuggling to support his cocaine habit. But a run-in with the Peruvian police sends him to a prison called 'House of the Devil.' Eddie tells the story of his daring escape.\", '2013-05-22', 45, 0.0, 0, '/k4bLs0uSh5xruyklsYmfPkKnyfG.jpg', None, 'c957f47f01e249459afe60e3b22538d9', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260771, 8, 'Vegas Mobster', \"Vegas, 1979, and Frank Cullotta's 'Hole in the Wall' gang is becoming notorious. The FBI catches up to him and while not exactly 'locked up abroad,' he enters witness protection. Now Frank shares his mob secrets.\", '2013-05-29', 45, 0.0, 0, '/9ZbRgjCHO2Lyb7OdTFxkByrLmP2.jpg', None, 'd159be36b41d40dfad69acbaee55b9ee', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260772, 9, 'Fast, Furious and Busted', 'Locked Up Abroad comes home to the United States to visit 19-year-old street racer Rick Cedar in Spokane, Washington.', '2013-06-05', 45, 0.0, 0, '/1ldDgVXrtxNDUcmHDSisMJMqscD.jpg', None, '0daadfb1e2c14ca681eb08a76de897bc', 'f184e989c7ef40149cc06720b02f0c2c', 3260774, 10, 'Hunting Mr. Nice', 'When British schoolteacher Howard Marks agrees to help an old friend finish off a drug deal, he has no idea that it will be the start of a new career.', '2013-06-12', 45, 0.0, 0, '/v6bZnADa2cDQl2wc4I8GGwKpHPu.jpg', None)"}
