{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:23.319603+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 79.68s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('b94f8ec6c8f24013b67407372bbf5a6f', '7bf2d0e599e94271b877ce5b732dc0f6', 3260778, 1, 'Plane Crash Marijuana', \"In 1972 Jim PapRocki is flying nearly a ton of marijuana from Mexico to the U.S. He's forced to crash land, with Mexican police hot on his heels.\", '2016-06-06', 45, 0.0, 0, '/i6BXdNDorDtqKVWz3gSCQ4Eumeb.jpg', None, '5616b436cba0448a8f329f6e6a11ebf9', '7bf2d0e599e94271b877ce5b732dc0f6', 3260783, 2, 'Thai Prison Hell', \"In 1993, 25-year-old Australian Martin Garnett is already earning good money at a luxury car dealership in Sydney, but he's hungry for more. He is caught smuggling 4.7 kilos of heroin into Bangkok and is set to become Australia's longest serving prisoner overseas.\", '2016-06-13', 45, 0.0, 0, '/qNY3xU4oLpl9CdZW2Q9UPghYTTq.jpg', None, '54236cf0ed9341948503b3b0658ee9d7', '7bf2d0e599e94271b877ce5b732dc0f6', 3260786, 3, 'Bogota Belly Bust', 'Tabitha Ritchie decides to fix her life after years of substance abuse and the loss of her children. But in Colombia she enters an even darker world.', '2016-06-20', 45, 0.0, 0, '/rMsycsSJRof7hymxUDsVYwsuD4W.jpg', None, '749c9daf9979463ab0383d9f85c7fa67', '7bf2d0e599e94271b877ce5b732dc0f6', 3260789, 4, 'Somali Pirate Hostage Hell', 'The shocking story of South African couple Debbie Calitz and Bruno Pelizzari, who were kidnapped by Somali pirates and held captive for 20 terrifying months.', '2016-06-27', 45, 0.0, 0, '/j7SnQouv5Dp2mRwAkpCnalHnvFI.jpg', None, '144dd4a0ff724242936d59034e2754fc', '7bf2d0e599e94271b877ce5b732dc0f6', 3260791, 5, \"Gadaffi's American Prisoner\", \"Captured by Gaddafi's men while fighting with rebels in Libya, Baltimore-born Matthew VanDyke spent nearly six months in solitary confinement.\", '2016-07-04', 45, 0.0, 0, '/4c57eUmZpAQxYe0RjeownxhjXS9.jpg', None, 'ba60cfdaca5a47ad91d636b0d41a747d', '7bf2d0e599e94271b877ce5b732dc0f6', 3260793, 6, 'Jungle Terror', 'The traumatic story of an American schoolboy and his mother, who were kidnapped by Abu Sayyaf, a jihadist group, in the Philippines and held for ransom in the jungle.', '2016-07-11', 45, 0.0, 0, '/nSDoRWUyHmZOFpPISB8BCzpMSuZ.jpg', None)"}
