{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:23.459221+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 79.82s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('02fa5e1cc72142cb9e89a38efcbf90a7', 'ef03b31ff71948f69d70fdc97c8c507b', 3260804, 1, 'Breaking Bad in Britain', 'The story of convicted drug dealer Pieter Tritton, whose organization used camping tents to smuggle cocaine from Ecuador to Europe.', '2018-01-04', 45, 0.0, 0, '/iEYjRDSBMOZl5weCHWUmCupMa76.jpg', None, 'f691706a434b4f38819775f04bd27737', 'ef03b31ff71948f69d70fdc97c8c507b', 3260807, 2, 'Narco at Nineteen', 'In 2012 Simone Blignaut has a lucrative job working for one of Johannesburg’s biggest drug dealers, but when her boss entrusts her to fly to Bolivia and secure a major cocaine deal, the 19-year-old is in over her head.', '2018-01-11', 45, 0.0, 0, '/ijvutAdrSK5DTA5yxzZVDmhFNuO.jpg', None, '014f02e491d14543a1782ed24812a895', 'ef03b31ff71948f69d70fdc97c8c507b', 3260813, 3, 'Double Crossed in the Desert', 'Journalist Phil is investigating illegally deployed chemical weapons when he’s taken hostage.', '2018-01-18', 45, 0.0, 0, '/kreEud0wwRC1Cig1tUSxnBjxMex.jpg', None, 'd1a69387b66e47948b0fe67dc16db3f4', 'ef03b31ff71948f69d70fdc97c8c507b', 3260818, 4, 'Mexican Border Bust', 'When smuggling marijuana was interrupted, Steve  faced time behind bars unless he could escape.', '2018-01-25', 45, 0.0, 0, '/v8VIOUKSVQ6v48fIbGIJmNXyHp8.jpg', None, '0a128ca97f114dd79181da90070fdcfd', 'ef03b31ff71948f69d70fdc97c8c507b', 3260837, 5, 'Escape From Al Qaeda', 'Kidnapped by Al Qaeda, Matthew must decide to escape or stay with his fellow American prisoner.', '2018-02-01', 45, 0.0, 0, '/br8JqfV03x6rjgBspYyFfACYec7.jpg', None, '362c7876e2604e7a8499b9879e6da01a', 'ef03b31ff71948f69d70fdc97c8c507b', 3260840, 6, 'Bad Bromance', 'Lemar must survive one of Colombia’s most brutal prisons, after getting caught with cocaine.', '2018-02-08', 45, 0.0, 0, '/fufNaKuvMEfm4dD4ZdyGBT8f5Mz.jpg', None)"}
