{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:23.611188+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 79.97s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('14bf206dc5c84ffcb9b69bf5b9acedbc', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260842, 1, 'Thailand/Thai Meth Bust', 'Jimmy gives up his job as a postman to open a bar in Thailand, but quickly starts dealing meth. The police get wise and in a dramatic takedown bust him and send him to prison.', '2019-01-02', 45, 0.0, 0, '/o98B6iLspcR9MNgcdRAqAU0LSl5.jpg', None, 'bfead3e4c5d944c3af6aa225ca843658', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260843, 2, 'Greece/Greek Border Bust', 'David embarks on an epic road trip, where he attempts to smuggle hash from Afghanistan to Germany. He is caught in Greece and imprisoned on an island.', '2019-01-09', 45, 0.0, 0, '/6Gkqu14AlbUpaO3gRAF2MwhIsJr.jpg', None, 'e210920199714084916dce626c8c9bec', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260845, 3, 'Dominican Republic/Caribbean Coke King', 'Unemployed Michael Singh tries cocaine smuggling to make money. But after 7 successful runs, Michael is caught and left to rot in a Dominican prison.', '2019-01-09', 45, 0.0, 0, '/uucCx84LJgga5fnZ9SCz0IRn8jp.jpg', None, 'd90374d793774402bd4435c99161aabd', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260847, 4, 'Mexico/Mexican Cartel Hell', \"In Mexico, Carlos Quijas is falsely imprisoned and tortured for drug smuggling. Inside Mexico's most dangerous prison, he has to get tough to survive.\", '2019-01-16', 45, 0.0, 0, '/vk1uU9s42afTjfACKboTxNiZ3xy.jpg', None, 'f1848e6a2cd6407bbb1812a4beed80e7', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/3SR8r6Tlqw4HE4kqirigA8HKg4s.jpg', None, '199d8ddd0d0e4c6bb6133e578fb2f722', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260853, 7, 'Colombia/Jungle Crash', \"On a mission to find drug labs in the Colombian jungle, Keith Stansell crashes. He's kidnapped by FARC guerrillas and held hostage for over five years.\", '2019-02-06', 45, 0.0, 0, '/qJ6bZYIOsp6wDX85Yw2dIVm2ZnM.jpg', None, 'efc3dd794bfb425488c77c06053dfa3e', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260855, 8, 'Panamania', 'Party girl Christina spirals into addiction but sees a way out through drug smuggling.', '2019-02-13', 45, 0.0, 0, '/5ionoVk4SKXfH13tYfmuxmsp4A0.jpg', None, 'a5b168915f4a458c94cc2dbc2be8b5e7', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260870, 9, 'Indian Hash Bust', 'Mark joins an ashram looking for enlightenment, but he finds himself locked up in India.', '2019-02-20', 45, 0.0, 0, '/uaSyoLbPh9BKdJggizMvXSdDUoK.jpg', None, '05c6414db3454e03acf81bbe4df5f98c', 'b409b9cf002d450d8b7cd85186d21a7c', 3260875, 10, 'Peruvian Parent Trap', 'Paris and Marlon travel to Peru for an exciting business opportunity—ending in the ultimate betrayal', '2019-02-27', 45, 0.0, 0, '/uTonMQPHeorXajxkTPrLFsnl6ox.jpg', None)"}
