{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:23.765102+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 80.13s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('d15976292cbe4c6fb8e356a4b1437410', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047037, 1, 'Undercover Biker', 'After his arrest, drug dealer Charles Falco is facing decades behind bars. Instead, he strikes a deal with the authorities and becomes a confidential informant - living a life undercover.', '2020-01-01', 45, 0.0, 0, '/83iCEL1wMBELBGNW8M9YKHfD2xt.jpg', None, '19943f421f414ba2bd02e2bd6e3617d6', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047036, 2, 'Korean Ecstasy King', \"In South Korea, English teacher Jesse Moskel becomes the kingpin of a huge MDMA smuggling operation - and one of Southeast Asia's most wanted men.\", '2020-01-08', 45, 0.0, 0, '/zEOPwtZxiwaFqiy82GYd12Zt75r.jpg', None, '3471eb07bb5f4c15b857b3cdeb245587', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047035, 3, 'Pop Star Smuggler', \"Jimmy Bauer is on the cusp of breaking into the music industry and only one thing stands in his way. Money. He faces moral temptation and life-changing decisions, all as he works out what's more important to him. The fame? Or the music?\", '2020-01-15', 45, 0.0, 0, '/jTyuPeyNdQiIkYzkKvoX94tCvvd.jpg', None, '0ac4e3db868a4376a9d23b98c7a2f047', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047053, 4, 'Undercover Arms Dealer', 'When legitimate arms dealer Peter Bleach is asked to supply weapons for a suspected Indian terrorist cell, he agrees to go undercover for British Intelligence to capture the ringleader.', '2020-01-22', 45, 0.0, 0, '/4Ms0uTtJj9SeiXfvaBlnpWq5puT.jpg', None, '6455d6dff1b94ce6b769cb01087bedc3', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/ovKGFqjDHhSaRfqA1Bu06CSHjyR.jpg', None, '5fcaa09782e24b96b82c70192997b081', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047056, 7, 'King of Weed', 'Ice hockey star Ryan Phillips risks it all when he starts smuggling marijuana across the U.S. border, costing him his family, career and freedom.', '2020-02-12', 45, 0.0, 0, '/9CDtc2zLokyqphgoJyXqawcA2AJ.jpg', None, '3b580dabde5e425ebc113b8f3731112e', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047057, 8, 'Colombian Double Cross', 'When the plan to smuggle marijuana from Mexico into the U.S. was interrupted, Steve Peterson faced time behind bars…unless he could find a way to escape.', '2020-02-19', 45, 0.0, 0, '/22KBBSK3u5aBgREOXO57xCAsS7j.jpg', None, 'e220ff3aec05490086389d2563db7743', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047058, 9, 'Peruvian Prison Break', 'A wild-living exotic dancer leaves the club scene of Florida to make a dangerous journey into Peru’s drugs underworld, culminating in an insane prison escape.', '2020-02-26', 45, 0.0, 0, '/lWsdepzdfHhnTtNOUYmiukT6f93.jpg', None, 'a2c0b62bd56b4f218a03aa95f1344093', '95116e597fe940b3a42599871a942c7e', 3047059, 10, 'Miami Mobster Take Down', 'Miami mobster Tony Galeota is locked up in Panama after being framed for drug dealing and human trafficking. Can he prove his innocence and escape?', '2020-03-04', 45, 0.0, 0, '/FVrjHT9o089jDhC6rxRIMqErWg.jpg', None)"}
