{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:23.915991+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 80.28s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('e5a0eb70feba48b9ae3ba4e8ff3fdb5a', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3260536, 1, 'Declassified Mexican Cartel Takedown', 'When a DEA Agent goes after a notorious cartel boss, he gets sucked into a treacherous world where a fatal mistake destroys his life.', '2021-09-02', 45, 0.0, 0, '/oqXdMdA5dwHw5RpcU676JfmepP.jpg', None, '48196f42513c4fcc9a9c1e77d2df4890', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3260537, 2, \"Meth's Top Model\", 'When a famous swimwear model builds a beauty brand, it becomes the perfect ruse to smuggle drugs around the world, until her double life implodes.', '2021-09-09', 45, 9.5, 1, '/GVI0ykdmhzBNXKNvWqyWSlel7R.jpg', None, '7595c0f649c54dfbb99410aa549706c1', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3260539, 3, 'Mafia Terminator', 'In this real life Goodfellas tale, New York teen John Alite gets a job at his local Deli, a hangout for ‘wise guys’. He soon finds himself wanting to be a mobster, and starts running errands for them.', '2021-09-16', 45, 0.0, 0, '/89IHZ4yEzVrIMepkAAvHAr5pOr7.jpg', None, '6d2bca78945a46d8adecc6bdff88954e', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3260545, 4, 'Declassified Undercover Crack Dealer', 'In this real-life version of Baltimore drama The Wire, local drug dealer Davon Mayer has a knack for making money. But when he gets arrested by two cops, to his surprise, they don’t want him in jail, they want him to sell drugs for their profit.', '2021-09-23', 45, 0.0, 0, '/w4CYBcSGduPsQ0PZGkzbeyLCZXi.jpg', None, 'b9c7d98c566c42bb886b978e46fedea1', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/uk8SnKsGoQR2feNkLldyRtf6VrS.jpg', None, '4fde63115fda4fb59126e3bbaa07406a', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3261249, 7, 'Declassified: A Rat’s Tale', 'When a lifelong gun runner and drug dealer infiltrates a blood thirsty biker gang for a million-dollar payout, he gets swept up in a horrific murder hit.', '2021-10-14', 45, 0.0, 0, '/2Mwn9XoO2Ja2XiQUPiLiDQx4M79.jpg', None, 'd1c68a8d0e0143cc844d94153a4fd199', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3349414, 8, 'Declassified Mole In The Mob', 'A Japanese-American Orange County kid gets his dream to become a gangster before a Las Vegas mob hit changes everything and he agrees to work for the ... (50 characters truncated) ... ay up the world of organised crime infiltrating the heights of mafia royalty in New York, before a planned hit threatens to destroy his entire world.', '2021-10-21', 45, 0.0, 0, '/6mmDUdyiiOMVr9OsVPaldnnzfLu.jpg', None, 'd2b57f638e1248e5aebe6ff681548acb', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3350897, 9, '50 Ton Pot Run', 'A 70s hippie and his naive pal are small time dealers selling hash to Boston college kids, until they get approached by a Colombian cartel keen to us ... (98 characters truncated) ... , shipping tens of tons of marijuana on freighters up the West Coast, until one of the biggest busts in US history forces them on the run to Bolivia.', '2021-10-28', 45, 0.0, 0, '/wKbDefxOc1aMPrbJjB5cDB9xGeU.jpg', None, '301d6b5c01b4444c9da3490040315cb6', 'fb421066ba6749a6b9cf12e85be89b0f', 3352337, 10, 'A Belly Full Of Coke', 'A troubled young father goes on the run to Spain to avoid a small prison sentence. He starts working for a crime gang in the Costa Del Sol and is ena ... (51 characters truncated) ... le and agrees to smuggle and swallow a kilo of cocaine back from Peru, only to face the biggest adrenalin kick of his life and seal his fate forever.', '2021-11-04', 45, 0.0, 0, '/aK6nULm8px0adkvyz6tXY0Hr1Uk.jpg', None)"}
