394bf99393986919ab3f98', 4119877, 8, 'Fighting Yaba', 'This installment details the true story of Boxing Billy Moore\\'s struggle to survive inside Klong Prem Prison, the notorious \"Bangkok Hilton\". Billy  ... (76 characters truncated) ... . He managed to overcome his inner demons for awhile, but eventually relapsed after trying yaba, which is a highly addictive form of methamphetamine.', '2022-11-23', 44, 0.0, 0, '/iGZxu86Oo3DZ1xHbVmZdbQA0dr2.jpg', None, '8a3bd5822b1c48a1bf973dcd94b01c5e', '0f65ef228c394bf99393986919ab3f98', 4119878, 9, 'Casualty of War', 'Veteran British soldier Brett Leonard Makinson, a retired parachute regiment medic, heads to India to overcome his PTSD but is soon tempted into smug ... (19 characters truncated) ... he Himalayas to various parts of Europe. Caught and jailed in India, he is tortured until he signs a blank piece of paper for the Indian authorities.', '2022-11-30', 44, 0.0, 0, '/oafvOVR3Gu3KTVMUD1a0tiVbjVB.jpg', None, '3bd581ba8b7040309490c535282d3d28', '0f65ef228c394bf99393986919ab3f98', 4119879, 10, 'Dame of Cocaine', 'This is the true story of Andrea Mohr from Germany. She was involved in international drug smuggling and other criminal activities such as organized  ... (79 characters truncated) ...  sentence from 1999 to 2004 in the high-security prison for women in Australia, in the Dame Phyllis Frost Centre near Melbourne, Victoria, Australia.', '2022-12-07', 44, 0.0, 0, '/x0BAEubnpe9YmyVotSNgUa2Y9wr.jpg', None)"}
