ou Asked for Miracles', 'Xavier and Robinson set their plans in motion while Sinatra works to preserve the status quo in Paradise.', '2025-02-18', 47, 5.724, 38, '/5HNIOzGkXAyp8qyTOK4kg0OnwQ.jpg', None, '8e6742e7f9f243d4a01836547ec35b84', '4ef5385e1820458f960b3d7f0be5d25f', 5813221, 7, 'The Day', 'Sinatra and Xavier confront the past, returning to the harrowing day that brought them to Paradise.', '2025-02-25', 58, 6.56, 42, '/hXIzbxpJpVy6Prvc5tbC6MPoZTz.jpg', None, 'f848d021c7a9479c87e8462927ac2d17', '4ef5385e1820458f960b3d7f0be5d25f', 5813222, 8, 'The Man Who Kept the Secrets', \"Xavier and Robinson race to find President Bradford’s murderer before it's too late.\", '2025-03-04', 46, 5.658, 38, '/1ZqroIZYHOa7mgthXGWVuGTCo0i.jpg', None)"}
