{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:24.541078+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 80.9s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('9cf42ae2d6c14867a0317024f2463fbc', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745017, 1, 'Graceland', 'Annie is a tour guide in Memphis, TN when the world ends. Her survival in the ensuing years after The Day is revealed as well as her encounter with a traveling group of survivors.', '2026-02-23', 60, 5.975, 40, '/6BctnBvrEBdRfkhILd1cvix7WCX.jpg', None, '110cbd4684c34476ad3272fc5bac2254', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745134, 2, 'Mayday', 'Xavier battles the elements and other threats as he follows a broadcast to Atlanta in search of his wife, Teri.', '2026-02-23', 46, 5.368, 34, '/dHAnbIgM8BbtR6t9LFCcIpBdRF4.jpg', None, '96c03d3107a148008156884fc97dc7d3', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745135, 3, 'Another Day in Paradise', 'Sinatra wakes to discover a new paradigm in the bunker and takes steps to safeguard its biggest secret.', '2026-02-23', 56, 5.258, 31, '/uIfgNiXbJFboCxemOtlTf9AdjYB.jpg', None, 'c44a71dbd5054308b56d50ec9ab012cf', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745136, 4, 'A Holy Charge', 'Xavier and Annie travel to Atlanta, contrasting life in this new world and the one he left behind in the bunker.', '2026-03-02', 54, 6.333, 33, '/hUP9sQh2QjuRMgirHjlT1bwrcMs.jpg', None, '1e97498fba43411a8450eac5f77826f5', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745137, 5, 'The Mailman', 'Xavier meets Gary and learns what happened to Teri on The Day.', '2026-03-09', 54, 5.919, 31, '/gMnJk4u9bWv1wod1uxfavauIISC.jpg', None, '20dd68779bc346f694242f12f7a87f39', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745138, 6, 'Jane', \"Xavier and Gary set their plan in motion. Back in Paradise, Sinatra takes action, while Gabriela follows a new lead, and Jane's past is revealed.\", '2026-03-16', 45, 6.22, 25, '/4h77tf4UGMJ2YtHCc1tsYlOJ5TP.jpg', None, '5dbf585a40f04897b3802cef81dc7691', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745139, 7, 'The Final Countdown', 'Xavier has unfinished business. Meanwhile, Sinatra meets with Link as Paradise prepares for a potential threat.', '2026-03-23', 58, 7.083, 24, '/bFpe4QW3WSZ28BzJdZSIlAH1xpx.jpg', None, '8dd61365c2a1427caa251957bd961777', 'e4f5b3f0f32c4de6810dc3d38a1c378e', 6745140, 8, 'Exodus', 'Worlds collide. Time is of the essence for Xavier. Link and his team spring into action. Sinatra puts it all on the line.', '2026-03-30', 53, 7.855, 31, '/6V2EnynbNcRDqJ7X8l7ye9SJYZ6.jpg', None)"}
