{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:27.349142+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 83.71s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('db2d96c2cd634e71a1cbda94bdbcc288', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5657578, 1, 'Call Tracking', 'After a disastrous mission in Bangkok, Peter goes AWOL to track an American agent accused of leaking secrets. Meanwhile, Rose receives a disturbing call.', '2025-01-23', 51, 6.744, 39, '/6jgkm5KkjzlbVA0fM9hGYPXtVxX.jpg', None, '44716522d21b444db5876bc65a51bce7', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5657579, 2, 'Disconnected', 'Reunited at last, Peter and Rose race to intercept Warren. Noor weighs using her access to classified Iranian intelligence for her own gain.', '2025-01-23', 52, 7.176, 34, '/1OeHmfUUNlke8w28XQMByV2EB55.jpg', None, '3512588acac648b1b83370334e2ed07e', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5657580, 3, 'Government Property', \"Catherine aids Peter's off-the-books investigation into Foxglove while Noor stumbles upon an unexpected encounter. A hijacking spirals out of control.\", '2025-01-23', 55, 6.969, 32, '/a2UEjzqNokRX8AyhfPprz29OOf1.jpg', None, '8b1c2b55968d49a4bfaf38a5e0ae6e36', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5657581, 4, 'Desperate Measures', \"Peter and Rose infiltrate a party at the Iranian ambassador's home, arousing Javad's suspicion. Tomás and Markus lock horns over the Foxglove plan.\", '2025-01-23', 55, 7.303, 33, '/rbDBaLjXsZ4oROsub95njSK8mEI.jpg', None, 'f0235e2ff8e14310bdba61204e225c28', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066' ... 20 parameters truncated ... '/gLpLZe3AmE66dB4dedG9UOQtSEk.jpg', None, '7bff42dd19d041fb8bb268fae2142521', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5657584, 7, 'Tilt', 'Peter plays hardball to force Solomon to talk. Following a lead, Rose seeks answers from a Foxglove scientist — but finds herself in a lethal situation.', '2025-01-23', 54, 7.19, 29, '/ekiwqzBvEWCnLHf4G3v6S3ircEN.jpg', None, '0dfa6a52fa82489ebcafee9d962eba4e', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5754862, 8, 'Divergence', 'Desperate to locate Rose, Peter makes a game-changing deal with Jacob. Tomás discovers just how far Markus is willing to go in service to his father.', '2025-01-23', 55, 7.407, 27, '/rOhBcrGbAFXVJBdlVqgIdhYgbGF.jpg', None, '4e8b670b545447b7a8a3c87f9a733059', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5754951, 9, 'Cultural Exchange', \"Breaching one of the most high-security locations in New York puts Peter's skills to the test. Rose and Dr. Cole enact a daring plan to stop Markus.\", '2025-01-23', 46, 7.389, 27, '/eoDg3hds2Jo62YQA2Kp6tbbBt9V.jpg', None, '04b608d06ffd42b2a4e25f94cf62a441', 'a97717697a7c48848273e16116585066', 5754953, 10, \"Buyer's Remorse\", 'With time running out, Peter and Rose scramble to prevent a mass casualty event. Catherine floats an intriguing proposal.', '2025-01-23', 46, 7.276, 29, '/r8e63lwEICx8uKIcwyjzec9FsO3.jpg', None)"}
