{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:27.814535+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 84.18s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('01cdaa1686414e8ba7c5c593ce24f241', 'fb110d40e75042bf9a2bf1a2fa264912', 4097232, 1, 'Episode 1', \"Former President George Mullen's comfortable retirement is upended after he's asked to lead an investigation into a horrific cyberattack.\", '2025-02-20', 50, 6.8, 31, '/21g2S1IetHHgNiDnFLfmMskat9I.jpg', None, 'f193814ba2494b30b969791a7640e3a6', 'fb110d40e75042bf9a2bf1a2fa264912', 5773732, 2, 'Episode 2', \"Mullen's commission investigates a hacking ring. President Mitchell weighs retaliation. A powerful figure has demands for Roger.\", '2025-02-20', 59, 6.6, 28, '/mqWDwTtNYVPYRKnb0RmMu9XtRcu.jpg', None, 'ef8a9b1c38354b15a6b4f47a044ab454', 'fb110d40e75042bf9a2bf1a2fa264912', 5773733, 3, 'Episode 3', \"Mullen's initial arrests draw blowback from the public — especially TV pundit Evan Green. Alex faces pressure to investigate her father.\", '2025-02-20', 51, 6.6, 27, '/3skvIi6EKl86Ftybyih7KftgL8i.jpg', None, 'c3d954ba6bfe4f30823e0386f27526ca', 'fb110d40e75042bf9a2bf1a2fa264912', 5773734, 4, 'Episode 4', \"A shock to the financial system increases scrutiny on Mullen's commission. Valerie investigates Proteus. Roger must make a difficult choice.\", '2025-02-20', 54, 6.6, 26, '/wefzP0WGXGSWfHHexWWHrmb3r2l.jpg', None, 'df9f0ef9af46428583d85bc115a076e7', 'fb110d40e75042bf9a2bf1a2fa264912', 5773735, 5, 'Episode 5', 'A personal tragedy reopens old wounds for the Mullen family. Speaker Dreyer pushes for a change in leadership. Sheila testifies before Congress.', '2025-02-20', 44, 6.8, 26, '/ge0hY7Me2ivvSz4dfBwT7dEwt8I.jpg', None, '8720eb590fa44bacb418b2cecc9943ef', 'fb110d40e75042bf9a2bf1a2fa264912', 5773736, 6, 'Episode 6', 'A new threat creates further unrest across the nation. As he narrows in on the culprit, Mullen is faced with an agonizing decision.', '2025-02-20', 54, 6.5, 25, '/m1bQkshHQU9WhSxY29xTiqIZYQx.jpg', None)"}
