{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:28.268815+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 84.63s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('26f7d65e5fa0433a90b9c5400fc33426', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 3728888, 1, 'Go West, Old Man', 'Dwight, blindsided by the news that his mob family has nothing left for him in New York, is sent to Tulsa, Oklahoma; as he settles in and surveys his new surroundings, Dwight wastes no time making new associates.', '2022-11-13', 42, 8.0, 105, '/dOe72mwnTFg6ec4gX8szoNgafEr.jpg', None, '894aad04c182418ca1ba409978d60bfa', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 3728890, 2, 'Center of the Universe', \"Dwight, Tyson, and Bodhi go on a road trip to take care of some business; Stacy does some digging into Dwight's past.\", '2022-11-20', 38, 8.1, 66, '/2CpHeTMQQJjgIAWXE3VyPeUPmux.jpg', None, '607b6f2438e1486cbb7fd386988c4e91', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 3941042, 3, 'Caprice', 'Dwight takes note of a possible new business opportunity. Later, a routine errand has an explosive, unexpected outcome. Stacy opens up to Dwight about what led her to Tulsa.', '2022-11-27', 40, 7.9, 62, '/ntW59Upv7ihGxHgYLTQDNYu5y4b.jpg', None, 'd51a2159c59f4911b0d5f4e13f6b1f2f', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 3947224, 4, 'Visitation Place', 'At the Tulsa Arena, Dwight and company test out their new plan, until a roadblock forces them to adjust and defend their turf. Tyson and his father argue about his future. Dwight gets an unexpected call.', '2022-12-04', 40, 8.1, 55, '/jTesVrxg1CkdKYHeQsYDOYDAW2R.jpg', None, 'b2a44f47374a4fa0bcf86a59878fa669', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5' ... 8 parameters truncated ... '/ef8FQKmaxMVyj19JubHl3mgOdIB.jpg', None, 'af7995038c8c48119f5d583a1c6334ba', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 4091915, 6, 'Stable', 'Dwight visits Tina before returning to Tulsa. Pete agrees to send Goodie to Oklahoma, while Roxy tries to keep the FBI at bay. Dwight has an offer for Mitch.', '2022-12-18', 40, 7.9, 55, '/pvsWgF9Q8KEKq1AAFXqt3mx1YB3.jpg', None, '15b7fea044034f08bea159f3554ce7f1', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 4099421, 7, 'Warr Acres', 'Stacy makes a decision that has serious consequences. Dwight and Armand dispose of evidence, and Bodhi proposes a new plan. Tina contemplates her future.', '2022-12-25', 43, 7.6, 58, '/bodFvKO9iKvtdzWG2E4MnBRtpRU.jpg', None, 'bc069c59ee634351a6fa209fddfe1fe4', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 4099422, 8, 'Adobe Walls', 'Dwight and Bodhi lay out the casino plan for Jimmy. As pressure increases, Dwight, Mitch, and Tyson assemble their team. Stacy confronts Waltrip.', '2023-01-01', 37, 8.2, 59, '/eCvaXeQvzDjxYPC9Vxv4va7RLGD.jpg', None, '6bd4435fefd049b1a5401bde1f7ab03c', '71094e26cce44095a0356339bb4de7f5', 4099423, 9, 'Happy Trails', \"It's all hands on deck as tensions between Dwight's crew and Waltrip escalate past the point of no return. Elsewhere, a flashback reveals what sent Dwight to prison 25 years ago.\", '2023-01-08', 43, 8.1, 59, '/5kme01g9nQhOwxaLs4corudfpoe.jpg', None)"}
