{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:30.022141+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 86.39s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('40da541adcec4ea0b198a74ca5a299e8', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1336275, 1, 'Back to the Grind', '18 months after parting ways under mysterious circumstances, the FBI team is brought back together by a new crisis.', '2017-10-27', 43, 6.9, 18, '/cBl8F5Ih1zRyRlhjuBYlkd2EzXy.jpg', None, '976726f6524e4ccb9ab8bd7cb698e751', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1383157, 2, 'Enemy Bag of Tricks', 'As the team adjusts to their new dynamic -- and the new tattoos -- they battle a dangerous foreign power that is trying to hijack a satellite.', '2017-11-03', 43, 6.4, 15, '/e9PiDXfmTrJkJT4V9RJ6Sg6t0JW.jpg', None, '864af571526049fb9f8d877eed1299fc', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1383158, 3, 'Upside Down Craft', 'While Jane and Weller hunt down a collective of dangerous computer hackers, Patterson and Rich Dot Com must work together to hide an explosive secret from their past.', '2017-11-10', 43, 6.4, 15, '/4k6pPnNqUeU3xoMueqcPnQJm4iv.jpg', None, 'afdceb62777c40688a3a317a002a4921', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1383159, 4, 'Gunplay Ricochet', \"As the team chases a deadly bomber who's terrorizing Manhattan, Jane uncovers a shattering secret from her youth.\", '2017-11-17', 43, 6.3, 15, '/tDrkkeolufLdH6VDWgBu6iWwHrM.jpg', None, '1b8ab4ba1b3c45cba4ad92b64bb06805', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5' ... 164 parameters truncated ... '/sEkAqgrhfePAs75INopxINKcG.jpg', None, 'ec43a94ba7b64ebe867bcc3b82658cda', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1466469, 19, 'Galaxy of Minds', 'The team must partner with an oddball conspiracy theorist to keep Crawford from acquiring a deadly weapon. Meanwhile, Roman struggles to maintain his personal life with Blake while completing a series of secret missions.', '2018-04-27', 43, 6.3, 15, '/7ZbXeddyP4gtowHalHRT8bGZImM.jpg', None, 'ffa29f4af5424b61b4755f6611f87914', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1467660, 20, 'Let It Go', \"After receiving shocking news about Avery's father, Jane and Weller must hunt down an elusive criminal. Meanwhile, Patterson's father helps the team in the lab.\", '2018-05-04', 42, 6.4, 17, '/ujsCqMSJLVcdJhWiouvLvvqitHy.jpg', None, 'bcf112d78ef74163865cb7c8f0da4559', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1467662, 21, 'Defection', 'Jane is forced to recruit someone from her past to help take down a dangerous alliance.', '2018-05-11', 43, 6.4, 16, '/ktvXHX10JsR15pht89BBw36jZQc.jpg', None, '04d6c2c2cfce41c9a381aa9b54e8abad', 'd5b7d418ebfd4965921f58fc2b1c29e5', 1467665, 22, 'In Memory', 'Jane and Weller hunt Roman back to where it all started and attempt to stop him.', '2018-05-18', 43, 6.0, 21, '/b1nbYvYBT4V9vouFZUlA62WR2vt.jpg', None)"}
