{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:31.156485+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 87.52s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('0f6a33b888474b45bff4e49872d9fc7e', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548059, 1, 'A Seeker is Born', \"In the series opener, Lok and Sophie are chased by Organization Suits after they discover Lok's father's journal and an ancient amulet.\", '2009-01-03', 25, 0.0, 0, '/fOifTm7Utnl4Zg5da6BKOujrBUl.jpg', None, '8fc0ae6d2c7b4bba8b987d4023534f45', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548060, 2, 'The Casterwill Client', \"Dante and Lok must escape The Organization and find a new place to hide while deciphering Lok's dad's journal. Sophie's place might be the perfect hideout, but whose side is she really on, and will her servants trust those she brings into her place?\", '2009-01-13', 25, 0.0, 0, '/9gC5xUHnp4LXXJxIFLDNjOqmSWz.jpg', None, '45bc4a6171434dd7a1989e61b9eef91c', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548061, 3, 'Words of Truth, Heart of Lies', \"Lok's father's journal leads them to Prague, where the strongest of Titans supposedly resides. It is also the capital of The Organization, meaning the gang is going to need more help... but who will volunteer?\", '2009-01-14', 25, 4.0, 1, '/3zkd0fCTrfvFmL6vNXWLr4LGcIK.jpg', None, 'cf883cd4c2cd4b2b8b5da766d487ceb0', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548062, 4, 'Into the River of Secrets', \"Dante is given the assignment to search for the mysterious Titan Gar-Ghoul, believed to be in Rouen, France, while developing Lok's summoning powers and his use with magical spells.\", '2009-01-15', 25, 0.0, 0, '/2usv6DK80gFkiBU5IEFTRYbHSIG.jpg', None, '7dc46dafca8b40638e79ce8412ec94a5', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8' ... 212 parameters truncated ... '/dDDVD09yoqCg73kEU8Hxq5bhskY.jpg', None, '8d23e6627f294c5c96637269d6cd9add', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548081, 23, 'To Be Together', 'The gang, now joined by Montahue and Tursley, set out to find the second legendary titan in Ethiopia. They have to pass not only the many traps insid ... (121 characters truncated) ... they together unleash the ancient titan? Both Lok and Sophie express their feelings for each other which allows Lok to bond with Legendary Titan Tao.', '2009-02-11', 25, 0.0, 0, '/ggrxst6TfHAa62oL7cwIo74hi2h.jpg', None, 'c98ae2566fb2431f9055be3a9ab9dd1f', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548082, 24, 'The Secret of Two Generations', \"The gang are at Metz's place where Lok shows him the ancient Amulet of Will, as well as the legendary titan, Tao. It is then when Metz tells him abou ... (187 characters truncated) ...  gang believes that Simon might have the last legendary titan. But after some investigation, they make a shocking discovery concerning the Professor.\", '2009-02-12', 25, 0.0, 0, '/t5GMkb1RDkU1AQ3mH7I0fcRungr.jpg', None, 'fedf22b0ded0470b87ae6e1627fdd250', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548083, 25, 'Divine Comedy', 'The gang, after much dissuasion from Metz and Gugenhiem, head to Prague to face the Professor head on at his castle.', '2009-02-13', 25, 0.0, 0, '/vx12rL7zqr0mW4sNVB1JNTZ357Z.jpg', None, '882ef0c566404199bd63c238a8531657', 'a411d93293d3490fa6eb8e5f004e6cc8', 548084, 26, 'Mission', 'After Dante is tricked into giving the Professor their legendary titans and his Caliban amulet, he is left shocked that the Professor deceived him. L ... (70 characters truncated) ... e from the titans positioned there to stop them, and Lok and Sophie go ahead to thwart the Professor. The Legendary Titan of Immortality is summoned.', '2009-02-16', 25, 0.0, 0, '/p91aPGV6zf9lRJf09BeSi8uvBRV.jpg', None)"}
