{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:31.634505+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 88s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('40a5f88903ef4a19b31406f007efd1b6', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548086, 1, 'Doorway to Huntik', \"The Huntik Team goes to The Organization's base and looks for information about Eathon Lambert. They then go to Peru and look for the waterfall menti ... (612 characters truncated) ... hon orders his son to help the Casterwill family to fight against the Spiral and gives him a clue: he has to interpret the prophecies of Nostradamus.\", '2011-09-17', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'cb4f0d72a29944d5a9c8abaa8386e12f', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548087, 2, 'The Tower of Nostradamus', \"A new Organization team led by the charismatic Wilder takes over the Tower of Nostradamus. Dante, Lok and the team manage to stop them with some help ... (2 characters truncated) ... rom Nostradamus' predictions. On the way a message from Lok's father and clues from the Ancient Seer point the way to Avalon and the Magic Willblade.\", '2011-09-18', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None, '843d75e74e2048d7a26d482abd0ec097', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548088, 3, 'Cave of the Casterwills', 'Lok and the Foundation team are on the trail of Avalon. Sophie is drawn to a crystal cave where she must prove herself to the Casterwill Elder Nimue. ... (73 characters truncated) ... th the titan she thought was lost, empowering her and turning her into Powerbonded Sabriel. Nimue promises to help her find Avalon and the Willblade.', '2011-09-24', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None, '993c9263bac1459b83cb00b4f88e69d5', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548089, 4, 'The Knight of Willblade', \"After Sophie's revelations in the Crystal Caves, the team search for Avalon and the fabled Willblade. Lady Casterwill tells them how her family allied themselves with the Titans when they first arrived on Earth.\", '2011-09-25', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None, '76d95ce7cc2a4cd8b6944415de9b354b', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920' ... 212 parameters truncated ... None, None, '4a35e066e0524b7a86d6c152bd176aab', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548108, 23, 'Words from Eathon', \"The longest night of the year begins at sundown and the Huntik Team races against time to find the Spiral Mark. Eathon appears to Lok and tells him how to find the last Quatraine. As Rassimov invokes Void to activate the Mark, Zhalia alerts Dante who brings the whole Team with Umbra's power.\", '2011-12-03', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None, '855ab11d16504e4f8383801227b6ba06', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548109, 24, 'The Spiral Mark', 'The Huntik Team try to prevent Rassimov from breaking the ancient seal of Lord Casterwill and activating the Spiral Mark. They must defeat Rassimov and his Titans and get Sophie to the center of the Mark where her Casterwill Legacy will prevent the use of the Mark.', '2011-12-04', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'c8850d22bb6040168b8bb6f831e82c18', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548110, 25, 'Lok and the Betrayer', \"Harrison and Den fight but Zhalia breaks cover to save them both from a cave in. The Casterwills and the Huntik Team clash with the Blood Spiral as L ... (6 characters truncated) ...  Sophie fight The Betrayer. Zhalia is hurt trying to save them from The Betrayer's Titan, Demigorgan, but she's rescued by Den and Harrison together.\", '2011-12-10', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None, 'e1d20154f24c497e8626d2f73dd22665', '4fcf8507753449e9a84dcffdfbf81920', 548111, 26, \"Dante's Return\", \"Den and Harrison join the fight against the Betrayer giving the Casterwills and the Team time to regroup, but the Betrayer's tricks are too strong, u ... (197 characters truncated) ... ms too strong and he finally manages to activate the Spiral Mark... and then Umbra appears and delivers all that is left of Dante: a pile of ashes...\", '2011-12-11', 25, 0.0, 0, None, None)"}
