{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:32.606574+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 88.97s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('8df9cacc22ca4c48b415ef4d269c7fae', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13297, 1, 'Through the Rabbit Hole', 'In a mix of science and magic, the Rabbit Talisman sends Jade back in time to 1976, where she encounters younger versions of Jackie, Uncle and even V ... (31 characters truncated) ... ds the Enforcers back to recover the Talisman (Which Jackie follows), they decide to try to change history by getting rid of the younger Jackie Chan.', '2001-09-08', 20, 8.2, 4, '/xkOkFirw3jYjGjcN5kvUDhd2SRh.jpg', None, '891d081ead204bb4bfb927b8bd8ed85c', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13267, 2, 'The Warrior Incarnate', 'Jackie and Uncle try to study the marking on the statue of Lo Pei, the warrior who scattered the Talismans, hoping to find clues to the remaining ones. When Jade shatters the statue, she finds a way to repair the damage, and brings the ancient warrior to life.', '2001-09-15', 20, 8.2, 4, '/msviSXqJutrmkDMCjjTo6Qxbfjl.jpg', None, 'c4d50a4777374fa7bb0e391c8c26ebb6', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13268, 3, 'Snake Hunt', 'Jackie and Jade set out to find the Snake Talisman in a cave in South America. They cross paths with an egotistical \"archaeologist\" shooting for a TV show. After catching wind of their quest the \"archaeologist\" steals the Talisman. Things become more complicated after the Dark Hand shows up.', '2001-09-22', 20, 8.5, 4, '/me63Bu6m3Isl5nNAa0sS9SALwpZ.jpg', None, 'a1470b23002945988a8c814b9de7f44a', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13269, 4, 'The Mother of All Battles', \"Tohru's mother comes to visit him and clashes with Uncle. Meanwhile, Tohru is almost seduced by a rival gang, the Black Hand to return to crime and help them steal the statue of the Golden Octopus.\", '2001-09-24', 20, 8.5, 4, '/eu5YsSdNc1oSSxQHxv7CmXZwK2X.jpg', None, '20a29694edcd4e358e9ca8e4e7407cb7', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b' ... 368 parameters truncated ... '/nnGHKvOJEHDT5GnKXFq9xcGvHlm.jpg', None, 'b09e954d4432445892848e3a98c80aeb', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13292, 36, 'The Good, the Bad, the Blind, the Deaf and the Mute', 'Uncle receives signs from Chi Master Fong, and follows them to the Hidden Valley. They find Daolon Wong as he prepares to unleash the dark chi held i ... (60 characters truncated) ... nd Jade is now deaf, and soon Uncle is captured by his archenemy. The team must learn to use their other senses to free Uncle and defeat Daolon Wong.', '2002-05-18', 20, 8.2, 4, '/qvAedYMPVPkI8lddmG0w3BKoByg.jpg', None, 'b5cd2d953f244a79bd4a1070176efbcf', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13293, 37, 'Shrink Rap', \"Jackie finds the Bands of Shiva. Hak Foo pursues Jacki back to Uncle's shop to get the bands. Jade casts a spell to make Hak Foo disappear, but inadvertently shrinks Jackie and Hak Foo.\", '2002-08-17', 20, 8.0, 4, '/7KtBAiCt87qK34gcXnOHokre9QX.jpg', None, 'a7a51fcb3fa6403abd8e1d56b18854ce', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13294, 38, \"I'll Be a Monkey's Puppet\", 'Jackie buys Jade a Monkey King puppet to help Jade in an upcoming talent show. They inadvertently release the Monkey King, and he quickly causes mischief. Jackie has been turned into a puppet.', '2002-08-24', 20, 8.0, 4, '/lPnObHq0LC0MWq5Ali3OknHAK5B.jpg', None, 'c84225d5378e413991fc7ee385ed3572', '8195e8842ef24ceab1a1fd4206db390b', 13287, 39, 'The Amazing T-Girl!', \"Captain Black is ordered to remove the Talismans from Section 13. So they're force to a new place for them. Daolon Wong tries for the Talismans, unaware that all the powers of the Talismans have been transferred into the Amazing T-Girl.\", '2002-09-07', 20, 8.2, 4, '/wHM0zkgsBCIeZD6WP0KZN1Wfawo.jpg', None)"}
