{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:33.129405+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 89.49s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('d9fe8d0bc31041de9a1f827a228578dd', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13298, 1, 'The Masks of the Shadowkhan', \"Daolon Wong's failed attempt to escape from prison through the use of magic reawakens Tarakudo, the king of the shadowkahn who is bent on recovering  ... (4 characters truncated) ... nine oni masks that imprison his generals.  Tarakudo attempts to free himself and his minions so that they can unleash total darkness upon the earth.\", '2003-09-13', 20, 8.5, 2, '/pxt5Ar07PGGLfbPY0JaCjvxQi0l.jpg', None, '391b55ac4a3041379d614b66c7a96d48', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13299, 2, 'Samurai Ratso', 'Ratso obtains the next Oni mask and has summoned a new deadlier type of Shadowkahn with sharp metallic claws and razor pointed feet that appear to be ... (14 characters truncated) ...  Meanwhile, Uncle begins to doubt himself as believes he is no longer useful to the group because he is not well versed in Japanese legend and magic.', '2003-09-20', 20, 8.5, 2, '/zdhls6IJGFCq2Cyfo5bED3ci0Kb.jpg', None, 'd865ca96f3af490591f4edc179ec364b', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13300, 3, 'The Amazing T-Troop', \"A new Oni mask has been discovered in San Fransisco.  Will Hak Fu finally get to wear the mask? No!  Who better than Jade's dog scruffy to command the new tribe of winged shadowkan?\", '2003-09-27', 20, 8.5, 2, '/foRKNSKsoMGZJ2NLcJ2rgsyHOMK.jpg', None, '21816306c7d1413ea3e830701dea1ad6', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13301, 4, 'Black Magic', \"While attempting to stop the Enforcers from getting the fourth oni mask, it accidentally lands on Captain Black's face.  He uses the powers of the ma ... (489 characters truncated) ... Tohru race to work on a way to keep the other three stored masks away from Black as they search for the ingredient needed to perform a removal spell.\", '2003-10-04', 20, 8.5, 2, '/7824x6RgCL9wfWweuuyRujRKwtu.jpg', None, 'd1821b16a08e47478fa6e3f260dfc912', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/rbEx93fPMOriVlhUWK74gYefsZu.jpg', None, 'c578402d8e414598ae4fceaebe00eb57', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13306, 10, 'Déjà Vu', \"Jade gets the surprise of her life when she is visited by... herself, from the future!  Future Jade is trying to stop Shendu's son, Drago, from getting a bunch of magic dragon's teeth so that he can free his father.\", '2004-01-17', 20, 8.5, 2, '/y1aEl6prjHCwiL7RFLXC1drAwLr.jpg', None, '80b586884e9343f08439a421e23f569a', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13307, 11, 'J2: Rise of the Dragons', 'The J-Team unites to battle the anti-J-Team, and Jade casts a spell that backfires and turns the J-Team into toddlers.', '2004-01-31', 20, 8.5, 2, '/od1Z6yAQHHt2jrorrSEm8yucWsY.jpg', None, '7adc68c81b4c4594b51c456f21caf352', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13308, 12, 'The J-Tots', \"Jackie and Daolon Wong literally race against time to retrieve the Déjà\\xa0 vu stone, which is responsible for their trip into the past.  Uncle attem ... (77 characters truncated) ... rough a time window.  As Jade watches, she begins to wonder whether she is responsible for all the problems that has been happening in Jackie's life.\", '2004-02-07', 21, 8.5, 2, '/w3m5276IVyoc9PAdIyj1PnLALpw.jpg', None, '3f479f30d92147cb91cd201aa7728ea1', '29e3953f8827493588b53e37904c1508', 13309, 13, 'Ninja Twilight', 'Jackie, Uncle, Tohru, and Jade discover that they have overlook something in the ancient writings by making the horrible mistake of placing the final ... (101 characters truncated) ... is generals from the masks that bind them.  The entire world begins to be engulfed in total darkness as the shadokahn are now free to walk the earth.', '2004-02-14', 20, 8.5, 2, '/kMDsadJufZx8r5ABP2OKPM2kV8T.jpg', None)"}
