rs truncated) ...  discover that they are the nephews of the Enforcers. She begins following and watching them, hoping to catch the three kids doing something illegal.', '2004-10-16', 20, 8.5, 2, '/Au6A9dK5VOPH8PvFz15KHaWKifh.jpg', None, '08949d0bffdb426a9ba9cd5b25da3d91', '4b978a7b6b844531bf215bd179d73fa5' ... 56 parameters truncated ... '/52EfkGYrz0SjLLBSvTfo5atFh1M.jpg', None, '29c5994310fe4962aaaed7dc324515da', '4b978a7b6b844531bf215bd179d73fa5', 13319, 10, 'Weight and See', 'The chi of the mountain demon, Po Kong is released after Tohru has a midnight snack whilst on a diet.', '2005-06-18', 20, 8.5, 2, '/68PNbTqLlrifVOPE6AVVn4N4uPT.jpg', None, 'd05e6fecc4984629b1190cf9acdf7bdc', '4b978a7b6b844531bf215bd179d73fa5', 13320, 11, 'J2: Revisited', 'A dark Chi-Wizard from the future called Iso travels to the past to steal one half of an ancient relic from Section 13.  Unbeknownst to Iso, Jade fol ... (109 characters truncated) ... shocked and disappointed to learn that adult Jade has so easily accepted the punishment of being demoted from field agent to desk duty at Section 13.', '2005-07-08', 20, 8.5, 2, '/yTaEGlV5tJRN0JxKE2vTtVAQHIz.jpg', None, '1220614e27334815bc3c80c1db5b2557', '4b978a7b6b844531bf215bd179d73fa5', 13321, 12, 'The Powers That Be (1)', \"Drago succeeds in capturing Jackie, Uncle, and Captain Black.  He holds them for ransom in order to get the prize that he so desperately wants, the C ... (95 characters truncated) ...  confront Drago and turn to an old enemy for research.  It appears that Jade and Tohru aren't the only ones hoping to double-cross the son of Shendu.\", '2005-06-25', 20, 8.5, 2, '/qaC7blSTH1OsMsYnoAg4VyBielB.jpg', None, '7adcf697ba0a4c6eac0c4837c3a5e110', '4b978a7b6b844531bf215bd179d73fa5', 13322, 13, 'The Powers That Be (2)', 'Captain Black, the J-Team, and some old adversaries put their differences aside to come together in order to stop Drago who is on the verge of conquering the entire world.', '2005-06-25', 20, 8.5, 2, '/erpl5G9jd