{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:35.558186+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 91.92s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('324fc52c1aaf4be2942482a4c8f48398', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 1690195, 1, 'The End', 'When the \"Captain Trips\" flu epidemic wipes out more than 99% of the population, the remaining few immune to the disease set out in search of other survivors, all the while, experiencing visions of the nurturing Mother Abagail and the menacing figure of The Dark Man.', '2020-12-17', 59, 6.207, 29, '/j4Zakq8VPdGFUszHNtT4jMh5R8Z.jpg', None, '4b80d9a9dbdf445b88737618ce4ea83e', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 2563545, 2, 'Pocket Savior', 'Musician Larry Underwood is on the cusp of his big break when \"Captain Trips\" strikes New York. Alone and wandering an empty city, he meets an alluri ... (31 characters truncated) ... ate to escape. Meanwhile, an incarcerated Lloyd Henreid comes face-to-face with Randall Flagg, The Dark Man himself, who makes him an enticing offer.', '2020-12-24', 66, 6.077, 26, '/3XP84B0EHue0gyNtveTRLMVuj43.jpg', None, '00b27aab7593407fb2564680f4a232f4', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 2585630, 3, 'Blank Page', 'Mother Abagail selects a surprising voice to be her conduit to her chosen Committee in Boulder: the young deaf man Nick Andros. The arrival of a dist ... (24 characters truncated) ... ulder Free Zone, shakes the Committee and Boulder residents to their core. Elsewhere in the Free Zone, Nadine Cross is haunted by a childhood memory.', '2020-12-31', 54, 5.826, 23, '/57VTEte2Y8mW0Q08pSc1l2zOwQ6.jpg', None, 'cf424a435bbe42d0aa06d374a013fba9', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 2621457, 4, 'The House of the Dead', 'The Boulder Free Zone Committee looks to solidify their leadership and bolster the community with a town hall meeting, but Flagg continues to make inroads as he plots to destroy the newly-forming society from within.', '2021-01-07', 60, 6.0, 20, '/dhvn4I44FKhNiUnwWKy59nax0Xo.jpg', None, '869cc65eff55484890da4cd55834f4f5', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0' ... 8 parameters truncated ... '/rqueSyctiasgINQ9xNGFeHnhCog.jpg', None, '7265fc29106b42b0885a7f209513e380', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 2626434, 6, 'The Vigil', \"While all of Boulder fears for Mother Abagail's safety, Stu organizes search parties to ensure her return, presenting an opportunity for Harold and Nadine. In New Vegas, Flagg recruits a dangerous new follower.\", '2021-01-21', 58, 5.632, 19, '/cyjfSdz7CDWtShnpDdcNCFL0gfx.jpg', None, 'c526b27ef2aa4766b4d3bb84ce19e91e', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 2682636, 7, 'The Walk', 'After tragedy strikes the Boulder Free Zone, Mother Abagail tasks members of her Committee with a dangerous mission. Meanwhile, Harold and Nadine begin their journey to New Vegas to unite with Flagg and claim their reward.', '2021-01-28', 58, 6.211, 19, '/9ar7OPFengmkzD48K5xrwVc9u5i.jpg', None, '523734f8a1c24be6b9195253ea5b38c1', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 2682638, 8, 'The Stand', \"Risking everything, the Boulder travelers face off with Flagg's followers in New Vegas, among them a very different - and pregnant - Nadine.\", '2021-02-04', 49, 6.0, 18, '/6phU0oKYEH7LJ6pPB9BtxCPqnyX.jpg', None, 'efc8041517484238863136a193fb07ea', 'f41277240e214ceea6daf1ddee5045d0', 2682639, 9, 'The Circle Closes', 'After seeing both the light and the dark, Frannie makes her stand.', '2021-02-11', 49, 5.286, 21, '/lv8mWmpLuVKDvLk7omaxaCM1fzt.jpg', None)"}
