{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T11:14:35.991403+00:00", "level": "INFO", "logger": "sqlalchemy.engine.Engine", "message": "[cached since 92.35s ago (insertmanyvalues) 1/1 (ordered)] ('44e4298ca40646fc8fd149aaada2e102', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 132536, 1, 'The Maddening Sprite of The Stump', \"Lula gets stuck in a tree stump during Dave's attempt to guard the Enchanted Forest against a giant man-eating muffin. When the royal family is unable to free Lula, a tiny, winged sprite establishes himself as the ruler of Udrogoth.\", '2004-01-23', 11, 0.0, 0, '/1pgBulfcbHyS3xDYAVyi0MhqH1x.jpg', None, '37a5066c224b4490ae45ea784f49e0cc', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 1324475, 2, 'Shrink Rap', 'Dave believes helping others is his whole purpose in life and starts giving out advice as a \"psychofloobicologist\".', '2004-01-23', 11, 0.0, 0, '/mJgHrk67ZDDpCaKiAxTftTWUSnj.jpg', None, '554e4e58fbde44bbbcb759ba9d9496c8', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 132546, 3, 'Pet Threat', 'Faffy is sad because the family forgot to get him anything during Dragon Appreciation Week, so Dave buys Faffy a diseased weasel for a pet.', '2004-01-23', 11, 10.0, 1, '/ymfdqgspIobam8M07WFXaLQsicj.jpg', None, '90de3c71efc640f19c2fd7a6aa838a10', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 132470, 4, \"Lula's First Barbarian\", \"Lula's old owner, Argon the Ageless, comes to town and Lula wants to find some way of getting him to come back to her.\", '2004-01-23', 11, 0.0, 0, '/oNQ6U6V790tIn1cDYa53l0h00v6.jpg', None, '6a466dcae860495e8a1a2971c8418baa', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e' ... 392 parameters truncated ... '/a5d4s4JDV6QOQH2dj3uUVCy8lhR.jpg', None, 'b9f4341eb96b40708038acce01a52134', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 132529, 38, 'Fiends & Family', 'When her parents announce that they have to start their quest all over again, Fang is crushed and cheering her up is a Herculean task.', '2005-01-21', 11, 0.0, 0, '/hsVxTu9UVa5PxFGEHuTmOTgKzDM.jpg', None, '68960004a968445fbb0bfcc13195afaf', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 132528, 39, 'PlunderBall', \"Dave finds himself coaching Udrogoth's Plunderball team in the big annual game, a job he knows nothing about. Things gets worse when the opposing team's coach is Dave's ex-girlfriend, Evil Princess Irmoplotz.\", '2005-01-21', 11, 0.0, 0, '/cZ4d1rLJPffkMPVt8ZOGccvQsmV.jpg', None, '93e6108c02104f62aa0e9a4c10be07b9', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 132549, 40, 'Not a Monkey', 'Fang gets an illness, so Dave take her to barber Ian, who is also an amateur doctor. He says that Fang is allergic to her own eyeballs, an allergy that only monkeys usually get.', '2005-01-22', 11, 0.0, 0, '/1lFC5n5fIXIGCCwal19GCtt9hg7.jpg', None, 'a2250a74555e4545ab108430485e0734', '210bd8818ece48f29d21f5ca5bc0422e', 132533, 41, 'Happy Glasses', 'When Chuckles the silly piggy sets to defeat Dave the barbarian once again, he invents glasses that make whoever is wearing it what they really want to world to be like.', '2005-01-22', 11, 0.0, 0, '/j09Yifnms7mjBRK3v2x2eP50P5d.jpg', None)"}
